{"tokens":{"aid":"06019"},"tracking":{"accountId":"06019"},"header":{"bannerImage":{"type":"image","src":"https://sites.omniballot.us/06019/app/banner.png"},"menu":[{"url":"/home","text":{"value":"Home","translations":{"es":"Inicio"}}},{"url":"http://www.co.fresno.ca.us/departments/county-clerk-registrar-of-voters","text":{"value":"Contact","translations":{"es":"Contacto"}}},{"url":"/statement","text":{"value":"VBM Challenge Form","translations":{"es":"Formulario de desafío VBM"}}}],"languages":{"en":{"value":"English"},"es":{"value":"Español"}}},"pages":[{"id":"home","type":"cta","title":{"value":"Welcome Fresno County Voters","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"es":"Bienvenido Votantes del Condado de Fresno"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>This site will help you access and return your absentee ballot, accessible Sample Ballot, and Voter Information Guide. Follow the screen prompts to view your ballot. Then, follow the instructions for marking and returning your voted ballot or viewing your ballot information. </p>","format":"html","style":"default","translations":{"es":"<p>Este sitio proveer&aacute; a todos los Votantes Registrados del Condado de Fresno con una boleta de muestra completamente accesible. Adem&aacute;s de recibir una muestra de su boleta oficial, puede usar este sistema para marcar a los candidatos que le interesan y descargar o imprimir una hoja de referencia para ayudarle a investigar sus opciones potenciales.</p>"}},"actions":[{"title":{"value":"Download my UOCAVA vote by mail Ballot","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"es":" Descargar mi UOCAVA boleta"}},"description":{"value":"","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"button":{"value":"Continue","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"es":"Continuar"}},"external":false,"page":"/pdf","value":"pdf","track":"pdf-start","hide":false},{"title":{"value":"View my Sample Ballot and Voter Guide","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"es":"Boleta de Muestra y el Folleto Oficial de Información al Votante"}},"description":{"value":"","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"button":{"value":"Continue","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Continuar"}},"external":false,"page":"/cvig","value":"cvig","track":"cvig-start","hide":false},{"title":{"value":"View my Remote Accessible Vote by Mail (RAVBM) Ballot","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Ver mi boleta de voto por correo accesible"}},"description":{"value":"","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"button":{"value":"Continue","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Continuar"}},"external":false,"page":"/ravbm","value":"ravbm","track":"ravbm-start","hide":false},{"title":{"value":"Fix a challenge to my VBM ballot return","format":"text","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Solucionar una impugnación de mi declaración de boleta de VBM"}},"description":{"value":"<p><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, STXihei, 华文细黑, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">If you received&nbsp;</span><strong style=\"font-weight: 700; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, STXihei, 华文细黑, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial;\">a notice that</strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, STXihei, 华文细黑, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">&nbsp;your signature was missing or doesn&rsquo;t match the signature on record, please select this option.</span> </p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Si recibi&oacute; <strong>un aviso que indique que</strong> falta su firma o que esta no coincide con la firma registrada, seleccione esta opci&oacute;n.</p>"}},"button":{"value":"Continue","format":"text","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Continuar"}},"external":false,"page":"/statement","value":"statement","track":"statement","hide":true}]},{"id":"pdf","type":"workflow","tokens":{"packageContext":"pdf"},"apps":[{"id":"vr","type":"vr","params":{"aid":"06019","vrAid":"06019","db":"1042","validationCodes":"lookup","onFound":"election","lookupFields":[{"label":"UI_FIRST_NAME","name":"fname","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"options":[],"operator":"equals","forceUpper":true},{"label":"UI_LAST_NAME","name":"lname","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"options":[],"operator":"equals","forceUpper":true},{"label":"UI_DOB","name":"dob","type":"date","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"format":"","autocomplete":"bday","options":[],"operator":"equals","forceUpper":false,"range":"2007-1901"}],"hiddenFields":[],"sampleVoters":[{"pid":"0000001","type":"0","validationCode":"lookup"},{"pid":"0000001","type":"5","fname":"uocava","party_code":"NON","validationCode":"lookup"},{"pid":"0000001","type":"8","fname":"ravbm","validationCode":"lookup"}],"lookupTitle":{"value":"Voter Lookup","translations":{"es":"Búsqueda del votante","zh-hant":"選民查找","tl":"Paghahanap ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता खोजना","ja":"有権者の検索","ko":"유권자 조회","ur":"ووٹر کی تلاش","vi":"Tra cứu Cử tri","km":"រក​មើល​ឈ្មោះ​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​"}},"lookupIntro":{"value":"<p>Please fill in the fields below to find your ballot.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Complete los siguientes campos para encontrar su boleta.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>請填寫以下欄位以查找您的選票。</p>","tl":"<p>Mangyaring punan ang mga patlang sa ibaba upang mahanap ang iyong balota.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया अपना मतपत्र पाने के लिए नीचे दिए गए खानों को भरें।</p>","ja":"<p>以下の欄に記入して、自分の投票用紙を検索してください。</p>","ko":"<p>귀하의 투표지를 찾으려면 아래 필드를 작성해 주십시오.</p>","ur":"<p>براہ کرم اپنے بیلٹ کی تلاش کے لیے ذیل کی جگہوں کو پر کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Vui lòng điền vào các ô bên dưới để tìm phiếu bầu của quý vị.</p>","km":"<p>សូម​បំ​ពេញនូវ​ព័ត៌​មាន​ផ្នែក​ខាងក្រោម​ដើម្បី​ស្វែង​រក​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​របស់​អ្នក ។​</p>"}},"confirmTitle":{"value":"Voter Information Found","translations":{"es":"Se encontró la información del votante","zh-hant":"找到的選民資訊","tl":"Nahanap ang Impormasyon ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता संबंधी जानकारी पाई गई","ja":"有権者情報が見つかりました","ko":"유권자 정보를 찾았습니다.","ur":"ووٹر کی معلومات مل گئیں","vi":"Đã Tìm Thấy Thông Tin Cử Tri","km":"ព័ត៌មាន​​​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោតត្រូវ​បាន​រក​ឃើញ"}},"confirmIntro":{"value":"<p>Please select your information from the list below.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Seleccione su información de la siguiente lista.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>請從下面的清單中選擇您的資訊。</p>","tl":"<p>Mangyaring piliin ang iyong impormasyon mula sa listahan sa ibaba.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया नीचे दी गई सूची से अपनी जानकारी का चयन करें।</p>","ja":"<p>以下のリストから自分の情報を選択してください。</p>","ko":"<p>아래 목록에서 귀하의 정보를 선택하십시오.</p>","ur":"<p>براہِ کرم مندرجہ ذیل فہرست میں سے اپنی معلومات منتخب کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Vui lòng chọn thông tin của quý vị từ danh sách bên dưới.</p>","km":"<p>សូម​ជ្រើស​រើស​ព័ត៌​​មាន​របស់អ្នក​​ពី​បញ្ជី​ខាង​ក្រោម​​ ។​</p>"}},"confirmNotFound":{"value":"I don't see my information above.","translations":{"es":"No veo mi información en la lista anterior.","zh-hant":"我在上面沒有看到我的資訊。","tl":"Hindi ko nakita ang aking impormasyon sa itaas.","hi":"मुझे ऊपर अपनी जानकारी नहीं दिखाई दे रही है।","ja":"上記には自分の情報はありません。","ko":"상기의 내 정보를 볼 수 없습니다.","ur":"مجھے اوپر اپنی معلومات نظر نہیں آئیں۔","vi":"Tôi không tìm thấy thông tin của tôi ở trên.","km":"ខ្ញុំ​មិន​ឃើញ​ព័ត៌​មាន​ខ្ញុំ​នៅ​ខាង​លើ​ទេ​ ។"}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"Voter information not found","translations":{"es":"No se encontró la información del votante","zh-hant":"未找到選民資訊","tl":"Hindi Nahanap ang imposmasyon ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता संबंधी जानकारी पाई गई","ja":"有権者の情報が見つかりません","ko":"유권자 정보를 찾을 수 없습니다.","ur":"ووٹر کی معلومات نہیں ملیں","vi":"Không Tìm Thấy Thông Tin Cử Tri","km":"ព័ត៌មាន​​​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោតរក​មិន​ឃើញ"}},"notFoundIntro":{"value":"<p>We were unable to find your information in our database. Please verify the information you entered is the same information you used to register to vote. Please contact <a href=\"/contact\">your local elections office</a> if you need assistance.</p>","format":"html","style":null,"translations":{"es":null}},"notFoundStartOver":{"value":"Click here to try again","translations":{"es":"Haga clic aquí para volver a intentarlo","zh-hant":"按一下此處重試","tl":"I-click dito upang subukang muli","hi":"दोबारा प्रयास करने के लिए यहाँ क्लिक करें","ja":"ここをクリックして、もう一度試してください","ko":"다시 시도하려면 여기를 클릭하십시오.","ur":"دوبارہ کوشش کے لیے یہاں کلک کریں","vi":"Bấm vào đây để thử lại","km":"សូម​ចុច​ទី​នេះ​ដើម្បី​សាក​ល្បង​ជា​ថ្មី"}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":true,"logicSets":[],"prev":"election-choice","next":"election"},{"id":"election","type":"election-select","logicSets":[{"breakOnMatch":false,"matchConditions":[{"test":"[voterTypeCode]","operator":"equals","value":"uocava","join":"or","caseSensitive":false}],"setTokens":[],"setTracking":[],"setParams":[],"setNext":"style"}],"ui":[],"params":{"aid":"[aid]","lookupVoterType":"[vr:type]","lookupParty":"[vr:party_code]","title":{"value":"Select an Election","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"instructions":{"value":"<p>Please select an election from the list below.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"searching":{"value":"<p>Searching for an election...</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"No Election found","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"notFoundMessage":{"value":"<p>We were unable to find a current election. Please check back closer to your election date. If you feel this is an error, please contact your local elections office.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"errorTitle":{"value":"Error","translations":{"es":"Error","zh-hant":"錯誤","tl":"Mali","hi":"त्रुटि","ja":"エラー","ko":"오류","ur":"نقص","vi":"Lỗi sai","km":"កំ​ហុស​"}},"errorMessage":{"value":"<p>Uh oh. Something is not quite right. [error]</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>¡Oh, no! Algo está mal. [error]</p>","zh-hant":"<p>啊。 出錯了。 [error]</p>","tl":"<p>Uh oh. May isang bagay na hindi tama. [error]</p>","hi":"<p>उह ओह। कोई चीज़ ठीक नहीं है। [error]</p>","ja":"<p>何かが間違っているようです。[error]</p>","ko":"<p>다시 시도해주세요. 잘못되었습니다. [error]</p>","ur":"<p>اوہ ہو۔ کچھ ٹھیک نہیں لگتا۔ [error]</p>","vi":"<p>Ồ. Có sai sót gì đó. [error]</p>","km":"<p>អ៊ុ អ៊ូ ។ មាន​អ្វី​មួយ​មិន​ត្រឹម​ត្រូវហើយ​ ។​ [error]</p>"},"tokens":{"error":"Error Message"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"access-denied","type":"html","params":{"title":{"value":"Access Denied","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"es":"Acceso denegado"}},"html":{"value":"<p>You are not allowed to access this page.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","translations":{"es":"<p>No tienes permiso para acceder a esta página.</p>"}},"hideActions":true},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"style","type":"style-select","ui":[],"params":{"aid":"[aid]","eid":"{eid}","partyMapping":false,"ignoreLeadingZeros":true,"title":{"value":"Select a Ballot","translations":{"es":"Seleccione una boleta","zh-hant":"選擇一張選票","tl":"Pumili ng isang Balota","hi":"मतपत्र चुनें","ja":"投票用紙の選択","ko":"투표용지를 선택하십시오.","ur":"ایک بیلٹ منتخب کریں","vi":"Chọn một Lá Phiếu"}},"instructions":{"value":"<p>You are not registered with a qualified political party. For the March 5, 2024, Presidential Primary Election, you are allowed to vote in one of the following party&rsquo;s ballots this election. Select which party&#39;s ballot you would like to vote.</p><p>To vote in the Presidential Primary for the Republican, Green, or Peace and Freedom parties, you must re-register to vote with that party. </p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>No est&aacute; registrado en un partido pol&iacute;tico calificado. Para la Elecci&oacute;n Primaria Presidencial del 5 de marzo de 2024, se le permite votar en una de las boletas del siguiente partido en esta elecci&oacute;n. Seleccione la boleta del partido que le gustar&iacute;a votar.</p><p>&nbsp;Para votar en las primarias presidenciales de los partidos Republicano, Verde o Paz y Libertad, debe volver a registrarse para votar con ese partido.</p>"}},"searchingForBallot":{"value":"<p>Searching for ballot...</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Buscando la boleta...</p>","zh-hant":"<p>尋找選票...... </p>","tl":"<p>Naghahanap ng balota...</p>","hi":"<p>मतपत्र की खोज हो रही है...</p>","ja":"<p>投票用紙を探しています...</p>","ko":"<p>투표 용지 검색 중...</p>","ur":"<p>بیلٹ کی تلاش کی جا رہی ہے۔۔۔</p>","vi":"<p>Tìm lá phiếu...</p>"}},"ballotOption":{"value":"[party]","translations":{"es":"Estilo de boleta [party]","zh-hant":"選票樣式 [party]","tl":"Uri ng Balota [party]","hi":"मतपत्र शैली [party]","ja":"投票用紙の形式 [party]","ko":"투표 용지 형태 [party]","ur":"بیلٹ سٹائل [party]","vi":"Kiểu Lá Phiếu [party]"},"tokens":{"code":"Style Code","name":"Style Name","party":"Party Name","party_code":"Party Code"}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"No ballot found","translations":{"es":"No se encontró la boleta","zh-hant":"沒有發現投票","tl":"Walang nahanap na balota","hi":"कोई मतपत्र नहीं मिला","ja":"投票用紙が見つかりません","ko":"투표 용지를 찾지 못 했습니다.","ur":"کوئی بیلٹ نہیں ملا","vi":"Không có lá phiếu nào được tìm thấy"}},"notFoundMessage":{"value":"<p>We were unable to locate a ballot for you this election. If you feel this is an error, please contact your local elections office.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>No podemos encontrar una boleta para usted en esta elección. Si cree que esto es un error, comuníquese con su funcionario electoral local.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>我們無法找到您這次選舉的投票。 如果您覺得這是一個錯誤，請聯絡您當地的選舉辦公室。</p>","tl":"<p>Hindi namin mahanap ang balota para sa iyo sa halalan na ito. Kung sa tingin mo ito ay isang pagkakamali, mangyaring makipag-ugnay sa iyong lokal na opisina ng halalan.</p>","hi":"<p>हम इस चुनाव में आपके लिए एक मतपत्र का पता लगाने में असमर्थ रहे। यदि आपको लगता है कि यह कोई ग़लती है, तो कृपया अपने स्थानीय चुनाव कार्यालय से संपर्क करें।</p>","ja":"<p>この選挙のあなたの投票用紙は見つかりませんでした。これが誤りであると思われる場合は、地方選挙事務所にご連絡ください。</p>","ko":"<p>이번 선거에서 귀하가 사용하실 투표지를 찾을 수 없습니다. 오류라고 생각되면 지역 선거 사무소에 문의하시기 바랍니다.</p>","ur":"<p>ہم اس الیکشن میں آپ کے لیے کوئی بیلٹ ڈھونڈنے سے قاصر ہیں۔ اگر آپ کو لگے کہ ایسا غلطی سے ہوا ہے تو براہ کرم اپنے مقامی الیکشن دفتر سے رابطہ کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Chúng tôi không tìm được lá phiếu cho quý vị trong cuộc bầu cử này. Nếu quý vị cảm thấy đây là lỗi sai, hãy liên hệ với văn phòng bầu cử địa phương của quý vị.</p>","km":"<p>យើង​មិន​អាច​រក​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​សម្រាប់​ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស​របស់​អ្នក​ឃើញ​ទេ​ ។​ ប្រ​សិន​បើ​អ្នក​​យល់​ថា​នេះ​ជា​កំ​ហុសនោះ សូម​ទាក់​ទង​ការិយាល័យ​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​ក្នុង​មូល​ដ្ឋាន​របស់​អ្នក ។​</p>"}},"errorTitle":{"value":"Error","translations":{"es":"Error","zh-hant":"錯誤","tl":"Mali","hi":"गड़बड़ी","ja":"エラー","ko":"오류","ur":"نقص","vi":"Lỗi sai","km":"កំ​ហុស​"}},"errorMessage":{"value":"<p>Uh oh. Something is not quite right. [error]</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>¡Oh, no! Algo está mal. [error]</p>","zh-hant":"<p>啊。 出錯了。 [error]</p>","tl":"<p>Uh oh. May isang bagay na hindi tama. [error]</p>","hi":"<p>उह ओह। कुछ बिलकुल सही नहीं है। [गड़बड़ी]</p>","ja":"<p>あれっ。何かが間違っているようです。[エラー]</p>","ko":"<p>죄송합니다. 문제가 발생했습니다. [error]</p>","ur":"<p>اوہ ہو۔ کچھ ٹھیک نہیں لگتا۔ [error]</p>","vi":"<p>Ồ. Có sai sót gì đó. [error]</p>","km":"<p>អ៊ុ អ៊ូ ។ មាន​អ្វី​មួយ​មិន​ត្រឹម​ត្រូវហើយ​ ។​ [error]</p>"},"tokens":{"error":"Error Message"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"package-builder","type":"package-builder","basePath":"package","params":{"aid":"[aid]","eid":"{eid}","overlays":{"Voter ID":"[vr:vid]","Voter Precinct":"[vr:pid]","First Name":"[vr:fname]","Last Name":"[vr:lname]","Date of Birth":"[vr:dob]","Resident Adddress":"[vr:raddress1] [vr:rcity] [vr:rstate] [vr:rzip]"},"showSessionWarning":false,"packageCode":"[voterTypeCode]-[packageContext]","packageAid":"[aid]","packageEid":"{eid}","label":{"value":"Download Return Package","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Descargar paquete de devolución","zh-hant":"下載交回郵件包","tl":"I-DOWNLOAD ANG PAKETENG PAMBALIK","vi":"TẢI XUỐNG BƯU KIỆN GỮI TRẢ LẠI","ja":"提出用パッケージのダウンロード","ko":"반송 패키지 다운로드","hi":"वापसी पैकेज डाउनलोड करें","ur":"","km":"ទាញយកកញ្ចប់​​ដែល​​ត្រូវ​បញ្ចូន​ត្រ​ឡប់​មក​វិញ​"}},"title":{"value":"Ballot Return Package","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Paquete de Devolución de Boletas","zh-hant":"選票交回郵件包","tl":"Paketeng Pambalik ng Balota","vi":"Bưu Kiện Lá Phiếu Gửi Trả Lại","ja":"投票用紙提出用パッケージ","ko":"투표지 반송 패키지","hi":"मतपत्र वापसी पैकेज","ur":"","km":"កញ្ចប់​​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​ត្រូវ​បញ្ចូន​ត្រ​ឡប់​មក​វិញ​"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>Please click the link below to start your download.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Por favor, haga clic en el enlace de abajo para empezar su descarga.","zh-hant":"請點擊下面的鏈接進行下載。","tl":"Paki-click ang link sa ibaba para simulan ang iyong download.","vi":"<p>Vui lòng nhấn đường link dưới đây để quý vị bắt đầu tải xuống.</p>","ja":"<p>下のリンクをクリックして、ダウンロードを開始してください。</p>","ko":"<p>아래 링크를 클릭하여 다운로드하십시오.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया अपना डाउनलोड शुरू करने के लिए नीचे दिए लिंक पर क्लिक करें।</p>","ur":"","km":"<p>សូម​ចុច​លើ​តំ​ណ​ភ្ជាប់​ខាង​ក្រោម​ដើម្បី​ចាប់​ផ្តើម​ការ​ទាញ​យក​ឯកសារ​របស់​អ្នក​ ។​</p>"}},"downloadButton":{"value":"Download Return Package","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Descargar paquete de devolución","zh-hant":"下載交回郵件包","tl":"I-DOWNLOAD ANG PAKETENG PAMBALIK","vi":"TẢI XUỐNG BƯU KIỆN GỮI TRẢ LẠI","ja":"提出用パッケージのダウンロード","ko":"반송 패키지 다운로드","hi":"वापसी पैकेज डाउनलोड करें","ur":"","km":"ទាញយកកញ្ចប់​​ដែល​​ត្រូវ​បញ្ចូន​ត្រ​ឡប់​មក​វិញ​"}},"building":{"value":"Building Return Package...","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Paquete de devolución del edificio...","zh-hant":"建築回歸套餐...","tl":"","vi":"","ja":"提出用パッケージの準備中...","ko":"반송 패키지를 구성하는 중입니다...","hi":"वापसी पैकेज बनाना...","ur":"","km":"ការ​បង្កើត​​កញ្ចប់ផ្ញើ​​ត្រឡ​ប់​មក​វិញ...​"}},"error":{"value":"There was an error building your ballot return package. Click on the following link to try again.","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Se produjo un error al generar su paquete de devolución de papeletas. Haga clic en el siguiente enlace para volver a intentarlo.","zh-hant":"建立您的選票返回包時出錯。單擊以下鏈接再試一次。","tl":"","vi":"","ja":"投票用紙提出用パッケージの準備中にエラーが発生しました。次のリンクをクリックして、もう一度やり直してください。","ko":"투표지 반송 패키지 구성 중 오류가 발생했습니다. 다음 링크를 클릭하여 다시 시도하십시오.","hi":"आपके मतपत्र वापसी पैकेज को बनाने में कोई गड़बड़ी हुई थी। दोबारा कोशिश करने के लिए निम्न लिंक पर क्लिक करें।","ur":"","km":"មាន​កំ​ហុស​នៅ​ក្នុង​ការ​បង្កើត​កញ្ចប់​​ផ្ញើ​ត្រឡប់​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​របស់​អ្នក​។​ សូម​ចុច​លើ​តំ​ណ​ភ្ជាប់​ខាង​​ក្រោម​ដើម្បី​សាក​ល្បង​ជា​ថ្មី ។"}},"pageTitle":{"value":"Ballot Return Package","translations":{"es":"Paquete de devolución de boletas"}},"pageIntro":{"value":"<p>Please click the link below to start your download.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"Por favor, haga clic en el enlace de abajo para empezar su descarga."}}},"ui":[],"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"hideContinueButton":false},{"id":"end-session","type":"end-session","params":{"title":{"value":"Thank You","format":"style","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Gracias!"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>Please follow the provided instructions to return your ballot.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Siga las instrucciones proporcionadas para devolver su boleta.</p>"}}},"ui":[]}]},{"id":"cvig","type":"workflow","apps":[{"id":"vr","type":"vr","params":{"aid":"06019","vrAid":"06019","db":"1042","validationCodes":"lookup","lookupFields":[{"label":"UI_FIRST_NAME","name":"fname","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"options":[],"operator":"equals"},{"label":"UI_LAST_NAME","name":"lname","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"options":[],"operator":"equals"},{"label":"UI_DOB","name":"dob","type":"date","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"format":"","autocomplete":"bday","options":[],"operator":"equals","range":"2007-1901"}],"hiddenFields":[],"sampleVoters":[{"pid":"0000001","type":"0","validationCode":"lookup"},{"pid":"0000001","type":"5","fname":"uocava","validationCode":"lookup"},{"pid":"0000001","type":"8","fname":"ravbm","validationCode":"lookup"}],"lookupTitle":{"value":"Voter Lookup","translations":{"es":"Búsqueda del votante","zh-hant":"選民查找","tl":"Paghahanap ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता खोजना","ja":"有権者の検索","ko":"유권자 조회","ur":"ووٹر کی تلاش","vi":"Tra cứu Cử tri","km":"រក​មើល​ឈ្មោះ​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​"}},"lookupIntro":{"value":"<p>Please fill in the fields below to find your ballot.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Complete los siguientes campos para encontrar su boleta.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>請填寫以下欄位以查找您的選票。</p>","tl":"<p>Mangyaring punan ang mga patlang sa ibaba upang mahanap ang iyong balota.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया अपना मतपत्र पाने के लिए नीचे दिए गए खानों को भरें।</p>","ja":"<p>以下の欄に記入して、自分の投票用紙を検索してください。</p>","ko":"<p>귀하의 투표지를 찾으려면 아래 필드를 작성해 주십시오.</p>","ur":"<p>براہ کرم اپنے بیلٹ کی تلاش کے لیے ذیل کی جگہوں کو پر کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Vui lòng điền vào các ô bên dưới để tìm phiếu bầu của quý vị.</p>","km":"<p>សូម​បំ​ពេញនូវ​ព័ត៌​មាន​ផ្នែក​ខាងក្រោម​ដើម្បី​ស្វែង​រក​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​របស់​អ្នក ។​</p>"}},"confirmTitle":{"value":"Voter Information Found","translations":{"es":"Se encontró la información del votante","zh-hant":"找到的選民資訊","tl":"Nahanap ang Impormasyon ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता संबंधी जानकारी पाई गई","ja":"有権者情報が見つかりました","ko":"유권자 정보를 찾았습니다.","ur":"ووٹر کی معلومات مل گئیں","vi":"Đã Tìm Thấy Thông Tin Cử Tri","km":"ព័ត៌មាន​​​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោតត្រូវ​បាន​រក​ឃើញ"}},"confirmIntro":{"value":"<p>Please select your information from the list below.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Seleccione su información de la siguiente lista.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>請從下面的清單中選擇您的資訊。</p>","tl":"<p>Mangyaring piliin ang iyong impormasyon mula sa listahan sa ibaba.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया नीचे दी गई सूची से अपनी जानकारी का चयन करें।</p>","ja":"<p>以下のリストから自分の情報を選択してください。</p>","ko":"<p>아래 목록에서 귀하의 정보를 선택하십시오.</p>","ur":"<p>براہِ کرم مندرجہ ذیل فہرست میں سے اپنی معلومات منتخب کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Vui lòng chọn thông tin của quý vị từ danh sách bên dưới.</p>","km":"<p>សូម​ជ្រើស​រើស​ព័ត៌​​មាន​របស់អ្នក​​ពី​បញ្ជី​ខាង​ក្រោម​​ ។​</p>"}},"confirmNotFound":{"value":"I don't see my information above.","translations":{"es":"No veo mi información en la lista anterior.","zh-hant":"我在上面沒有看到我的資訊。","tl":"Hindi ko nakita ang aking impormasyon sa itaas.","hi":"मुझे ऊपर अपनी जानकारी नहीं दिखाई दे रही है।","ja":"上記には自分の情報はありません。","ko":"상기의 내 정보를 볼 수 없습니다.","ur":"مجھے اوپر اپنی معلومات نظر نہیں آئیں۔","vi":"Tôi không tìm thấy thông tin của tôi ở trên.","km":"ខ្ញុំ​មិន​ឃើញ​ព័ត៌​មាន​ខ្ញុំ​នៅ​ខាង​លើ​ទេ​ ។"}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"Voter information not found","translations":{"es":"No se encontró la información del votante","zh-hant":"未找到選民資訊","tl":"Hindi Nahanap ang imposmasyon ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता संबंधी जानकारी पाई गई","ja":"有権者の情報が見つかりません","ko":"유권자 정보를 찾을 수 없습니다.","ur":"ووٹر کی معلومات نہیں ملیں","vi":"Không Tìm Thấy Thông Tin Cử Tri","km":"ព័ត៌មាន​​​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោតរក​មិន​ឃើញ"}},"notFoundIntro":{"value":"<p>We were unable to find your information in our database. Please verify the information you entered is the same information you used to register to vote. Please contact <a href=\"/contact\">your local elections office</a> if you need assistance.</p>","format":"html","style":null,"translations":{"es":null}},"notFoundStartOver":{"value":"Click here to try again","translations":{"es":"Haga clic aquí para volver a intentarlo","zh-hant":"按一下此處重試","tl":"I-click dito upang subukang muli","hi":"दोबारा प्रयास करने के लिए यहाँ क्लिक करें","ja":"ここをクリックして、もう一度試してください","ko":"다시 시도하려면 여기를 클릭하십시오.","ur":"دوبارہ کوشش کے لیے یہاں کلک کریں","vi":"Bấm vào đây để thử lại","km":"សូម​ចុច​ទី​នេះ​ដើម្បី​សាក​ល្បង​ជា​ថ្មី"}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":true,"logicSets":[]},{"id":"election","type":"election-select","logicSets":[],"ui":[],"params":{"aid":"[aid]","lookupVoterType":"default","lookupParty":"[vr:party_code]","title":{"value":"Select an Election","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"instructions":{"value":"<p>Please select an election from the list below.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"searching":{"value":"<p>Searching for an election...</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"No Election found","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"notFoundMessage":{"value":"<p>We were unable to find a current election. Please check back closer to your election date. If you feel this is an error, please contact your local elections office.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"errorTitle":{"value":"Error","translations":{"es":"Error","zh-hant":"錯誤","tl":"Mali","hi":"त्रुटि","ja":"エラー","ko":"오류","ur":"نقص","vi":"Lỗi sai","km":"កំ​ហុស​"}},"errorMessage":{"value":"<p>Uh oh. Something is not quite right. [error]</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>¡Oh, no! Algo está mal. [error]</p>","zh-hant":"<p>啊。 出錯了。 [error]</p>","tl":"<p>Uh oh. May isang bagay na hindi tama. [error]</p>","hi":"<p>उह ओह। कोई चीज़ ठीक नहीं है। [error]</p>","ja":"<p>何かが間違っているようです。[error]</p>","ko":"<p>다시 시도해주세요. 잘못되었습니다. [error]</p>","ur":"<p>اوہ ہو۔ کچھ ٹھیک نہیں لگتا۔ [error]</p>","vi":"<p>Ồ. Có sai sót gì đó. [error]</p>","km":"<p>អ៊ុ អ៊ូ ។ មាន​អ្វី​មួយ​មិន​ត្រឹម​ត្រូវហើយ​ ។​ [error]</p>"},"tokens":{"error":"Error Message"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"style","type":"style-select","ui":[],"params":{"aid":"[aid]","eid":"{eid}","partyMapping":false,"ignoreLeadingZeros":true,"title":{"value":"Select a Ballot","translations":{"es":"Seleccione una boleta","zh-hant":"選擇一張選票","tl":"Pumili ng isang Balota","hi":"मतपत्र चुनें","ja":"投票用紙の選択","ko":"투표용지를 선택하십시오.","ur":"ایک بیلٹ منتخب کریں","vi":"Chọn một Lá Phiếu"}},"instructions":{"value":"<p>You are not registered with a qualified political party. For the March 5, 2024, Presidential Primary Election, you are allowed to vote in one of the following party&rsquo;s ballots this election. Select which party&#39;s ballot you would like to vote.</p><p>To vote in the Presidential Primary for the Republican, Green, or Peace and Freedom parties, you must re-register to vote with that party.&nbsp;</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>No est&aacute; registrado en un partido pol&iacute;tico calificado. Para la Elecci&oacute;n Primaria Presidencial del 5 de marzo de 2024, se le permite votar en una de las boletas del siguiente partido en esta elecci&oacute;n. Seleccione la boleta del partido que le gustar&iacute;a votar.</p><p>&nbsp;Para votar en las primarias presidenciales de los partidos Republicano, Verde o Paz y Libertad, debe volver a registrarse para votar con ese partido.</p>"}},"searchingForBallot":{"value":"<p>Searching for ballot...</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Buscando la boleta...</p>","zh-hant":"<p>尋找選票...... </p>","tl":"<p>Naghahanap ng balota...</p>","hi":"<p>मतपत्र की खोज हो रही है...</p>","ja":"<p>投票用紙を探しています...</p>","ko":"<p>투표 용지 검색 중...</p>","ur":"<p>بیلٹ کی تلاش کی جا رہی ہے۔۔۔</p>","vi":"<p>Tìm lá phiếu...</p>"}},"ballotOption":{"value":"[party]","translations":{"es":"Estilo de boleta [party]","zh-hant":"選票樣式 [party]","tl":"Uri ng Balota [party]","hi":"मतपत्र शैली [party]","ja":"投票用紙の形式 [party]","ko":"투표 용지 형태 [party]","ur":"بیلٹ سٹائل [party]","vi":"Kiểu Lá Phiếu [party]"},"tokens":{"code":"Style Code","name":"Style Name","party":"Party Name","party_code":"Party Code"}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"No ballot found","translations":{"es":"No se encontró la boleta","zh-hant":"沒有發現投票","tl":"Walang nahanap na balota","hi":"कोई मतपत्र नहीं मिला","ja":"投票用紙が見つかりません","ko":"투표 용지를 찾지 못 했습니다.","ur":"کوئی بیلٹ نہیں ملا","vi":"Không có lá phiếu nào được tìm thấy"}},"notFoundMessage":{"value":"<p>We were unable to locate a ballot for you this election. If you feel this is an error, please contact your local elections office.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>No podemos encontrar una boleta para usted en esta elección. Si cree que esto es un error, comuníquese con su funcionario electoral local.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>我們無法找到您這次選舉的投票。 如果您覺得這是一個錯誤，請聯絡您當地的選舉辦公室。</p>","tl":"<p>Hindi namin mahanap ang balota para sa iyo sa halalan na ito. Kung sa tingin mo ito ay isang pagkakamali, mangyaring makipag-ugnay sa iyong lokal na opisina ng halalan.</p>","hi":"<p>हम इस चुनाव में आपके लिए एक मतपत्र का पता लगाने में असमर्थ रहे। यदि आपको लगता है कि यह कोई ग़लती है, तो कृपया अपने स्थानीय चुनाव कार्यालय से संपर्क करें।</p>","ja":"<p>この選挙のあなたの投票用紙は見つかりませんでした。これが誤りであると思われる場合は、地方選挙事務所にご連絡ください。</p>","ko":"<p>이번 선거에서 귀하가 사용하실 투표지를 찾을 수 없습니다. 오류라고 생각되면 지역 선거 사무소에 문의하시기 바랍니다.</p>","ur":"<p>ہم اس الیکشن میں آپ کے لیے کوئی بیلٹ ڈھونڈنے سے قاصر ہیں۔ اگر آپ کو لگے کہ ایسا غلطی سے ہوا ہے تو براہ کرم اپنے مقامی الیکشن دفتر سے رابطہ کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Chúng tôi không tìm được lá phiếu cho quý vị trong cuộc bầu cử này. Nếu quý vị cảm thấy đây là lỗi sai, hãy liên hệ với văn phòng bầu cử địa phương của quý vị.</p>","km":"<p>យើង​មិន​អាច​រក​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​សម្រាប់​ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស​របស់​អ្នក​ឃើញ​ទេ​ ។​ ប្រ​សិន​បើ​អ្នក​​យល់​ថា​នេះ​ជា​កំ​ហុសនោះ សូម​ទាក់​ទង​ការិយាល័យ​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​ក្នុង​មូល​ដ្ឋាន​របស់​អ្នក ។​</p>"}},"errorTitle":{"value":"Error","translations":{"es":"Error","zh-hant":"錯誤","tl":"Mali","hi":"गड़बड़ी","ja":"エラー","ko":"오류","ur":"نقص","vi":"Lỗi sai","km":"កំ​ហុស​"}},"errorMessage":{"value":"<p>Uh oh. Something is not quite right. [error]</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>¡Oh, no! Algo está mal. [error]</p>","zh-hant":"<p>啊。 出錯了。 [error]</p>","tl":"<p>Uh oh. May isang bagay na hindi tama. [error]</p>","hi":"<p>उह ओह। कुछ बिलकुल सही नहीं है। [गड़बड़ी]</p>","ja":"<p>あれっ。何かが間違っているようです。[エラー]</p>","ko":"<p>죄송합니다. 문제가 발생했습니다. [error]</p>","ur":"<p>اوہ ہو۔ کچھ ٹھیک نہیں لگتا۔ [error]</p>","vi":"<p>Ồ. Có sai sót gì đó. [error]</p>","km":"<p>អ៊ុ អ៊ូ ។ មាន​អ្វី​មួយ​មិន​ត្រឹម​ត្រូវហើយ​ ។​ [error]</p>"},"tokens":{"error":"Error Message"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"vig","type":"voter-guide","params":{"aid":"06019","title":{"value":"County Voter Information Guide","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"zh-hant":"縣選民資訊指南","hi":"काउंटी मतदाता जानकारी गाइड","ja":"郡の有権者情報ガイド","ko":"카운티 유권자 정보 가이드","es":"Guía de información para los votantes del condado","tl":"Gabay sa Impormasyon ng Botante ng County","ur":"کاؤنٹی کی ووٹر معلومات کی گائیڈ","vi":"Bản Hướng Dẫn Thông Tin Cử Tri Quận","km":"ព័ត៌មានណែ​នាំ​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​នៅ​ក្នុង​​ខោន​ធី"}},"tabInstructions":{"value":"Instructions","translations":{"es":"Instrucciones","zh-hant":"說明","tl":"Mga Tagubilin","hi":"निर्देश","ja":"説明","ko":"안내","ur":"ہدایات","vi":"Hướng dẫn","km":"សេចក្តី​ណែនាំ"}},"tabCandidates":{"value":"Candidate Statements","translations":{"es":"Declaraciones del candidato","zh-hant":"候選人陳述","tl":"Mga Pahayag ng Kandidato","hi":"उम्मीदवार के वक्तव्य","ja":"候補者の声明","ko":"후보자 성명서","ur":"امیدواروں کے بیانات","vi":"Tuyên Bố của Ứng Cử Viên","km":"សេចក្តី​​ថ្លែង​ការណ៍​​របស់​​បេក្ខជន"}},"tabMeasures":{"value":"Measures","translations":{"es":"Medidas","zh-hant":"議案","tl":"Mga Panukala","hi":"विधेयक","ja":"法案","ko":"법안","ur":"اقدامات","vi":"Các Điều Luật cần Bỏ Phiếu","km":"វិធានការ"}},"tabAdditionalInfo":{"value":"Additional Info","translations":{"es":"Información adicional","zh-hant":"附加資訊","tl":"Karagdagang Impormasyon","hi":"अतिरिक्त जानकारी","ja":"追加情報","ko":"추가 정보","ur":"اضافی معلومات","vi":"Thông Tin Bổ Sung"}},"tabReferenceBallot":{"value":"Reference Ballot","translations":{"es":"Boleta de referencia","zh-hant":"參考選票","tl":"Reference na Balota","hi":"संदर्भ मतपत्र","ja":"参照用投票用紙","ko":"참조 투표지","ur":"حوالے کا بیلٹ","vi":"Phiếu Bầu Tham Khảo","km":"សន្លឹក​​​ឆ្នោតជា​ឯកសារ​យោង"}},"instructionsIntro":{"value":"<p>This is your Accessible Voter Information Guide and Sample Ballot. You will find a list of available information pertaining to this election by clicking on the links provided.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Esta es su Guía accesible de información para los votantes y su Boleta de muestra. Encontrará una lista de la información disponible perteneciente a esta elección al hacer clic en los enlaces proporcionados.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>這是您的無障礙選民資訊指南和樣本選票。 按一下提供的連結，即可找到與本次選舉有關的可用資訊清單。</p>","tl":"<p>Ito ang iyong Magagamit na Gabay sa Impormasyon ng Botante at Halimbawa na Balota. Makikita mo ang isang listahan ng mga impormasyong maaaring gamitin na nauukol sa halalang ito sa pamamagitan ng pag-click sa mga link na ibinigay.</p>","hi":"<p>यह आपकी सुलभ मतदाता जानकारी गाइड और नमूना मतपत्र है। आपको प्रदान किये गये लिंकों पर क्लिक करके इस चुनाव से संबंधित उपलब्ध जानकारी की एक सूची मिलेगी।</p>","ja":"<p>これは、バリアフリーの有権者情報ガイドおよび投票用紙見本です。リンクをクリックすると、今回の投票に関連して入手できる情報の一覧表が表示されます。</p>","ko":"<p>본 투표지는 귀하의 접근 가능한 유권자 정보 가이드 및 견본 투표지입니다. 제공된 링크를 클릭하여 이 선거와 관련해 이용 가능한 정보 목록을 볼 수 있습니다.</p>","ur":"<p>یہ آپ کی قابل رسائی ووٹر کی معلومات کی گائیڈ اور بیلٹ کا نمونہ ہے۔ آپ مہیا کردہ لنکوں پر کلک کرکے اس الیکشن کی بابت دستیاب معلومات کی ایک فہرست حاصل کریں گے۔</p>","vi":"<p>Đây là Hướng dẫn cho Thông Tin Cử tri Khuyết tật và Lá Phiếu Mẫu. Quý vị sẽ tìm thấy danh sách các thông tin có sẵn liên quan đến cuộc bầu cử này bằng cách nhấp vào các đường link được cung cấp.</p>","km":"<p>នេះ​ជា​ព័ត៌មានណែនាំ​ដល់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​​ និង​សន្លឹក​​ឆ្នោត​​គំរូរបស់​អ្នក​ដែល​អាច​ទទួល​បាន​ ។​ អ្នក​នឹង​ទទួល​បាន​បញ្ជី​ព័ត៌​មាន​ដែល​មាន​​អំ​ពី​ការ​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​នេះ​ ដោយ​ចុច​លើ​តំ​ណ​ភ្ជាប់​ដែលបាន​​ផ្តល់​ឲ្យ​ ។​</p>"}},"candidatesIntro":{"value":"<p>The Candidate Statements that appear in this guide provide each candidate an opportunity to speak to voters regarding his or her background, education, qualifications, and platform.</p><p>Including a statement in this guide is at the option of the candidates and those that choose to do so are required to purchase the space. Some candidates choose not to purchase space for a statement; therefore, this guide may not contain a statement for every candidate on your ballot.</p><p>If nothing is present, there are no candidates on the ballot in your jurisdiction.</p>","format":"html","style":null,"translations":{"zh-hant":"<p>本指南中的候選人陳述為每位候選人提供了一個與選民進行交流的機會，可以介紹自己的背景、教育程度、資歷和競選綱領。</p><p>候選人可自行選擇在本指南中包含一份陳訴，而那些選擇這樣做的候選人需要購買該空間。 有些候選人選擇不購買陳述空間，因此，本指南可能不包含選票上每位候選人的陳訴。</p><p>如果選票上沒有候選人，即表明您的選區沒有候選人在選票上。</p>","hi":"<p>इस गाइड में दिखाई देने वाले उम्मीदवारों के वक्तव्य प्रत्येक उम्मीदवार को अपनी पृष्ठभूमि, शिक्षा, योग्यताओं, और प्लेटफॉर्म के संबंध में मतदाताओं से बात करने का अवसर प्रदान करते हैं।</p><p>उम्मीदवारों के पास विकल्प होता है कि वे इस गाइड में वक्तव्य शामिल करें या न करें और जो उम्मीदवार वक्तव्य शामिल करना चुनते हैं, उन्हें स्थान खरीदने की जरूरत होती है। कुछ उम्मीदवार वक्तव्य के लिए स्थान न खरीदना चुनते हैं; इसीलिए, हो सकता है कि इस गाइड में आपके मतपत्र पर प्रत्येक उम्मीदवार का वक्तव्य शामिल न हो।</p><p>अगर कुछ भी मौजूद नहीं है, तो मतपत्र पर आपके अधिकार क्षेत्र का कोई उम्मीदवार नहीं है।</p>","ja":"<p>本ガイドでは、候補者の声明として、候補者に自身の経歴、学歴、資格、および政綱を選挙民に伝達する機会を提供しています。</p><p>本ガイドへの声明掲載の有無は個々の候補者の選択によるものであり、声明を掲載することを選択した候補者は掲載枠を購入する必要があります。中には声明の掲載枠を購入しないことを選択した候補者もいるため、投票用紙に記載されている候補者全員の声明が本ガイドに含まれているわけではありません。</p><p>何も示されていない場合は、その区域の選挙には候補者がいないということになります。</p>","ko":"<p>본 안내서에서 보시는 후보 성명서는 각 후보가 유권자에게 각자의 배경, 교육, 자격 및 경력에 대하여 피력할 수 있는 연단을 제공합니다.</p><p>본 안내서에 성명서를 포함하는 것은 후보의 선택이며, 이 기회를 활용하고자 하는 후보는 홍보 공간을 구매하였습니다. 일부 후보는 성명서를 게재할 공간을 구매하지 않았습니다. 따라서, 본 안내서는 귀하가 투표할 수 있는 후보자 모두의 성명서를 포함하고 있지 않습니다.</p><p>화면에 내용이 보이지 않는 경우는, 귀하의 선거구에 후보가 없기 때문입니다.</p>","es":"<p>Las declaraciones de candidatos que aparecen en esta guía le brindan a cada candidato la oportunidad de dirigirse a los votantes con respecto a sus antecedentes, educación, calificaciones y plataforma.</p><p> La inclusión de una declaración en esta guía queda al exclusivo criterio de los candidatos, pero aquellos que decidan hacerlo deben adquirir el espacio. Algunos candidatos deciden no adquirir el espacio para incluir una declaración; por lo tanto, es posible que esta guía no incluya un declaración de cada candidato en su boleta.</p><p>Si no hay ninguna declaración, no hay candidatos en la boleta en su jurisdicción.</p>","tl":"<p>Ang mga Pahayag ng Kandidato na inilathala sa gabay na ito ay nagbibigay sa bawat kandidato ng pagkakataon upang makipag-usap sa mga botante tungkol sa kanilang karanasan, edukasyon, mga kwalipikasyon, at plataporma.</p><p>Kabilang ang isang pahayag sa gabay na ito ay nasa opsyon ng mga kandidato at ang piniling gawin ito ay kinakailangang magbayad para sa ispasiyo. Ang ilang mga kandidato ay pinili na huwag bumili ng ispasiyo para sa isang pahayag; samakatwid, ang gabay na ito ay maaaring hindi naglalaman ng pahayag ng bawat kandidato sa iyong balota.</p><p>Kung walang makikita, walang mga kandidato sa iyong balota sa iyong nasasakupan.</p>","ur":"<p>اس فہرست میں ظاہر ہونے والے امیدواروں کے بیانات ہر امیدوار کو موقع فراہم کرتے ہیں کہ وہ اپنے پس منظر، تعلیم، اہلیتوں اور پلیٹ فارم کے حوالے سے ووٹروں سے مخاطب ہو سکے۔</p><p>اس گائیڈ میں ایک بیان شامل کرنے کا انحصار امیدواروں پر ہے اور جو ایسا کرنے کا انتخاب کریں انہیں جگہ خریدنا ہوتی ہے۔ کچھ امیدوار بیان کے لیے جگہ نہ خریدنے کا انتخاب کرتے ہیں؛ چناں چہ ہوسکتا ہے کہ آپ کے بیلٹ پر موجود ہر امیدوار کا بیان اس گائیڈ میں موجود نہ ہو۔</p><p>اگر کچھ بھی موجود نہیں تو آپ کے حلقے میں بیلٹ پر کوئی امیدوار نہیں ہے۔</p>","vi":"<p>Các Tuyên Bố của Ứng Cử Viên ở trong hướng dẫn này cung cấp cho mỗi ứng cử viên một cơ hội để trình bày với cử tri về lý lịch, trình độ học vấn, tiêu chuẩn điều kiện và diễn đàn chính trị của họ.</p><p>Các ứng cử viên được tùy chọn có kèm bản tuyên bố vào bản hướng dẫn này hay không và những người chọn làm như vậy phải mua ô thông tin này. Một số ứng cử viên quyết định không mua ô thông tin để viết tuyên bố; do đó, hướng dẫn này có thể không có tuyên bố cho mỗi ứng cử viên trên lá phiếu của quý vị</p><p>Nếu không có thông tin nào hiện ra, không có ứng cử viên nào trong cuộc bỏ phiếu trong thẩm quyền của quý vị.</p>"}},"measuresIntro":{"value":"<p>Below is information about the measures that will appear on your ballot. If nothing is present, there are no measures on the ballot in your jurisdiction.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>A continuación, encontrará información sobre las medidas que aparecerán en su boleta. Si no hay ninguna, no hay medidas en la boleta en su jurisdicción.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>以下是關於您選票上將出現的議案的資訊。 如果選票上沒有議案，即表明您的選區沒有議案在選票上。</p>","tl":"<p>Sa ibaba ay ang impormasyon tungkol sa mga panukala na makikita sa iyong balota. Kung walang makikita, walang mga panukala sa balota sa iyong nasasakupan.</p>","hi":"<p>नीचे उन विधेयकों के बारे में जानकारी दी गई है, जो आपके मतपत्र पर दिखाई देंगे। अगर कुछ भी मौजूद नहीं है, तो मतपत्र पर आपके अधिकार क्षेत्र का कोई विधेयक नहीं है।</p>","ja":"<p>以下は、投票用紙に記載される法案に関する情報です。何も示されていない場合は、その区域の選挙には法案がないということになります。</p>","ko":"<p>다음은 귀하의 투표 용지에 소개된 정책관련 정보입니다. 화면에 내용이 보이지 않는 경우는, 귀하의 선거구와 관련된 정책이 없기 때문입니다.</p>","ur":"<p> ذیل میں ان اقدامات کے بارے معلومات ہیں جو آپ کے بیلٹ پر ظاہر ہوں گے۔ اگر کچھ بھی موجود نہیں تو آپ کے حلقہ میں بیلٹ پر کوئی اقدامات نہیں ہیں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Dưới đây là thông tin về các điều luật cần bỏ phiếu sẽ xuất hiện trên lá phiếu của quý vị. Nếu không có thông tin nào hiện ra, không có điều luật cần bỏ phiếu nào trong cuộc bỏ phiếu trong thẩm quyền của quý vị.</p>"}},"fullMeasureText":{"value":"Full Text","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"zh-hant":"","hi":"पूरा पाठ","ja":"全文","ko":"전문","es":"","tl":"","ur":"","vi":"Toàn Văn Bản","km":"អត្ថបទពេញ"}},"argumentsFor":{"value":"Arguments For","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"zh-hant":"","hi":"पक्ष में तर्क","ja":"への賛成意見","ko":"다음에 대한 찬성론","es":"","tl":"","ur":"","vi":"Lập Luận Ủng Hộ","km":"សេចក្ដី​អះអាង"}},"argumentsAgainst":{"value":"Arguments Against","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"zh-hant":"","hi":"विरुद्ध तर्क","ja":"への反対意見","ko":"다음에 대한 반대론","es":"","tl":"","ur":"","vi":"Lập Luận Chống ","km":"សេចក្ដី​អះអាងជំ​ទាស់​"}},"additionalInformationIntro":{"value":"<p>Below is a list of links to additional information about this election.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>A continuación, encontrará una lista de los enlaces para acceder a información adicional sobre esta elección.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>以下是有關這次選舉其他資訊的連結列表。</p>","tl":"<p>Sa ibaba ay isang listahan ng mga link sa karagdagang impormasyon tungkol sa halalang ito.</p>","hi":"<p>नीचे इस चुनाव के बारे में अतिरिक्त जानकारी के लिंक की सूची दी गई है।</p>","ja":"<p>以下はこの選挙に関する追加情報へのリンク一覧です。</p>","ko":"<p>다음은 본 선거 관련 추가 정보를 보실 수 있는 사이트 목록입니다.</p>","ur":"<p>ذیل میں اس الیکشن کے بارے اضافی معلومات کے لیے لنکوں کی ایک فہرست ہے۔</p>","vi":"<p>Dưới đây là danh sách đường link liên kết tới thông tin bổ sung về cuộc bầu cử này.</p>"}},"notFound":{"value":"This content has been disabled or no longer exists.","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"zh-hant":"","hi":"यह कॉन्टेंट डिसेबल कर दिया गया है या अब मौजूद नहीं है ।","ja":"この内容は無効になっているか、または存在していません。","ko":"이 콘텐츠는 비활성화되었거나 더 이상 존재하지 않습니다.","es":"","tl":"","ur":"","vi":"Nội dung này đã bị vô hiệu hóa hoặc không còn tồn tại.","km":"ខ្លឹមសារ​នេះ​ត្រូវ​បាន​​បិទ​មិន​ឲ្យ​ដំ​ណើរការ​បាន ឬ​លែង​មាន​ទៀត​ហើយ​ ។"}},"sampleBallotTitle":{"value":"Reference Ballot","translations":{"es":"Boleta de referencia","zh-hant":"參考選票","tl":"Reference na Balota","hi":"संदर्भ मतपत्र","ja":"参照用投票用紙","ko":"참조 투표지","ur":"حوالے کا بیلٹ","vi":"Phiếu Bầu Tham Khảo","km":"សន្លឹក​​​ឆ្នោតជា​ឯកសារ​យោង"}},"sampleBallotIntro":{"value":"<p>The following information is a list of contests just as they will appear on your ballot. You may click on a candidate name or measure response to mark it for future reference.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>La siguiente información es una lista de las contiendas electorales tal como aparecerán en su boleta. Puede hacer clic en el nombre de un candidato o en la respuesta de la medida para marcarla para futura referencia.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>您的選票將有以下的選舉項目。您可以點撃候選人的姓名或提案，標記您的選擇，作為日後參考之用。</p>","tl":"<p>Ang sumusunod na impormasyon ay isang listahan ng mga paligsahan tulad ng makikita mo sa iyong balota. Maaari mong i-click ang pangalan ng isang kandidato o tugon sa panukalang-batas upang markahan ito para maging reperensiya sa hinaharap.</p>","vi":"<p>Thông tin sau đây là danh sách các tranh cử, thông tin này cũng sẽ được ghi trên lá phiếu của quý vị. Quý vị có thể chọn vào tên ứng cử viên hoặc dự luật cần bỏ phiếu để đánh dấu nó, dùng để tham khảo trong tương lai.</p>","ja":"<p>以下の情報は、投票用紙に掲載されるのと同じ選挙項目のリストです。候補者の氏名または法案への回答をクリックして、将来の参照のために印をつけることができます。</p>","ko":"<p>다음 정보는 귀하의 투표지에 표시될 콘텐츠의 목록입니다. 후보자 이름이나 법안에 대한 답변을 클릭하여 나중에 참고할 수 있도록 표시하시면 됩니다.</p>","hi":"<p>निम्नलिखित जानकारी उन मुकाबलों की एक सूची है जैसे कि वे आपके मतपत्र पर दिखाई देंगे। आप किसी उम्मीदवार के नाम या विधेयक उत्तर पर क्लिक कर सकते हैं जिससे भविष्य में देखने के लिए इस पर निशान लगाया जा सके।</p>","ur":"","km":"<p>ព័ត៌មានខាង​ក្រោម​ជា​បញ្ជី​ឈ្មោះ​បេក្ខជនចូលរួម​​ប្រ​កួត​​ដែល​ដូច​គ្នា​ទៅ​នឹង​អ្វី​ដែលមាន​​លើ​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​របស់​អ្នក​ ។ អ្នក​អាច​ចុច​លើ​ឈ្មោះ​បេក្ខជន ឬ​វិធានការ​ឆ្លើយ​តប​ណាមួយ​ដើម្បី​គូស​វា​សម្រាប់​ជា​ឯកសារ​យោង​នា​ពេល​អនាគត​ ។​</p>"}},"printSampleBallot":{"value":"Print Reference Ballot","translations":{"es":"Imprimir Boleta de Referencia","zh-hant":"列印參考選票","tl":"I-print ang Reference na Balota","hi":"संदर्भ मतपत्र प्रिंट करें","ja":"参照用投票用紙を印刷する","ko":"참조 투표지","ur":"پرنٹ حوالہ","vi":"Phiếu Bầu Tham Khảo","km":"ព្រីនសន្លឹក​​​ឆ្នោតជា​ឯកសារ​យោង​​"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"ui":[]}]},{"id":"ravbm","type":"workflow","tokens":{"packageContext":"ravbm"},"apps":[{"id":"vr","type":"vr","params":{"aid":"06019","vrAid":"06019","db":"1042","validationCodes":"lookup","lookupFields":[{"label":"UI_FIRST_NAME","name":"fname","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"options":[],"operator":"equals","forceUpper":true},{"label":"UI_LAST_NAME","name":"lname","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"options":[],"operator":"equals","forceUpper":true},{"label":"UI_DOB","name":"dob","type":"date","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"format":"","autocomplete":"bday","options":[],"operator":"equals","range":"2007-1901"}],"hiddenFields":[],"sampleVoters":[{"pid":"0000001","type":"0","validationCode":"lookup"},{"pid":"0000001","type":"5","fname":"uocava","validationCode":"lookup"},{"pid":"0000001","type":"8","fname":"ravbm","validationCode":"lookup"}],"lookupTitle":{"value":"Voter Lookup","translations":{"es":"Búsqueda del votante","zh-hant":"選民查找","tl":"Paghahanap ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता खोजना","ja":"有権者の検索","ko":"유권자 조회","ur":"ووٹر کی تلاش","vi":"Tra cứu Cử tri","km":"រក​មើល​ឈ្មោះ​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​"}},"lookupIntro":{"value":"<p>Please fill in the fields below to find your ballot.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Complete los siguientes campos para encontrar su boleta.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>請填寫以下欄位以查找您的選票。</p>","tl":"<p>Mangyaring punan ang mga patlang sa ibaba upang mahanap ang iyong balota.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया अपना मतपत्र पाने के लिए नीचे दिए गए खानों को भरें।</p>","ja":"<p>以下の欄に記入して、自分の投票用紙を検索してください。</p>","ko":"<p>귀하의 투표지를 찾으려면 아래 필드를 작성해 주십시오.</p>","ur":"<p>براہ کرم اپنے بیلٹ کی تلاش کے لیے ذیل کی جگہوں کو پر کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Vui lòng điền vào các ô bên dưới để tìm phiếu bầu của quý vị.</p>","km":"<p>សូម​បំ​ពេញនូវ​ព័ត៌​មាន​ផ្នែក​ខាងក្រោម​ដើម្បី​ស្វែង​រក​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​របស់​អ្នក ។​</p>"}},"confirmTitle":{"value":"Voter Information Found","translations":{"es":"Se encontró la información del votante","zh-hant":"找到的選民資訊","tl":"Nahanap ang Impormasyon ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता संबंधी जानकारी पाई गई","ja":"有権者情報が見つかりました","ko":"유권자 정보를 찾았습니다.","ur":"ووٹر کی معلومات مل گئیں","vi":"Đã Tìm Thấy Thông Tin Cử Tri","km":"ព័ត៌មាន​​​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោតត្រូវ​បាន​រក​ឃើញ"}},"confirmIntro":{"value":"<p>Please select your information from the list below.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Seleccione su información de la siguiente lista.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>請從下面的清單中選擇您的資訊。</p>","tl":"<p>Mangyaring piliin ang iyong impormasyon mula sa listahan sa ibaba.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया नीचे दी गई सूची से अपनी जानकारी का चयन करें।</p>","ja":"<p>以下のリストから自分の情報を選択してください。</p>","ko":"<p>아래 목록에서 귀하의 정보를 선택하십시오.</p>","ur":"<p>براہِ کرم مندرجہ ذیل فہرست میں سے اپنی معلومات منتخب کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Vui lòng chọn thông tin của quý vị từ danh sách bên dưới.</p>","km":"<p>សូម​ជ្រើស​រើស​ព័ត៌​​មាន​របស់អ្នក​​ពី​បញ្ជី​ខាង​ក្រោម​​ ។​</p>"}},"confirmNotFound":{"value":"I don't see my information above.","translations":{"es":"No veo mi información en la lista anterior.","zh-hant":"我在上面沒有看到我的資訊。","tl":"Hindi ko nakita ang aking impormasyon sa itaas.","hi":"मुझे ऊपर अपनी जानकारी नहीं दिखाई दे रही है।","ja":"上記には自分の情報はありません。","ko":"상기의 내 정보를 볼 수 없습니다.","ur":"مجھے اوپر اپنی معلومات نظر نہیں آئیں۔","vi":"Tôi không tìm thấy thông tin của tôi ở trên.","km":"ខ្ញុំ​មិន​ឃើញ​ព័ត៌​មាន​ខ្ញុំ​នៅ​ខាង​លើ​ទេ​ ។"}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"Voter information not found","translations":{"es":"No se encontró la información del votante","zh-hant":"未找到選民資訊","tl":"Hindi Nahanap ang imposmasyon ng Botante","hi":"मतदाता संबंधी जानकारी पाई गई","ja":"有権者の情報が見つかりません","ko":"유권자 정보를 찾을 수 없습니다.","ur":"ووٹر کی معلومات نہیں ملیں","vi":"Không Tìm Thấy Thông Tin Cử Tri","km":"ព័ត៌មាន​​​សម្រាប់​អ្នក​បោះ​ឆ្នោតរក​មិន​ឃើញ"}},"notFoundIntro":{"value":"<p>We were unable to find your information in our database. Please verify the information you entered is the same information you used to register to vote. Please contact <a href=\"/contact\">your local elections office</a> if you need assistance.</p>","format":"html","style":null,"translations":{"es":null}},"notFoundStartOver":{"value":"Click here to try again","translations":{"es":"Haga clic aquí para volver a intentarlo","zh-hant":"按一下此處重試","tl":"I-click dito upang subukang muli","hi":"दोबारा प्रयास करने के लिए यहाँ क्लिक करें","ja":"ここをクリックして、もう一度試してください","ko":"다시 시도하려면 여기를 클릭하십시오.","ur":"دوبارہ کوشش کے لیے یہاں کلک کریں","vi":"Bấm vào đây để thử lại","km":"សូម​ចុច​ទី​នេះ​ដើម្បី​សាក​ល្បង​ជា​ថ្មី"}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"logicSets":[]},{"id":"election","type":"election-select","ui":[],"params":{"aid":"[aid]","lookupVoterType":"[vr:type]","lookupParty":"[vr:party_code]","title":{"value":"Select an Election","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"instructions":{"value":"<p>Please select an election from the list below.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"searching":{"value":"<p>Searching for an election...</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"Election currently unvailable","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":" Elección actualmente no disponible","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"notFoundMessage":{"value":"<p>The election you chose is currently not available. &nbsp;If you believe this is an error, <a href=\"http://www.co.fresno.ca.us/departments/county-clerk-registrar-of-voters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">please contact your local elections office</a>.</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>La elecci&oacute;n que eligi&oacute; no est&aacute; disponible actualmente. Si cree que se trata de un error, <a href=\"http://www.co.fresno.ca.us/departments/county-clerk-registrar-of-voters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">comun&iacute;quese con su oficina electoral local</a>.</p>","zh-hant":"","tl":"","hi":"","ja":"","ko":"","ur":"","vi":""}},"errorTitle":{"value":"Error","translations":{"es":"Error","zh-hant":"錯誤","tl":"Mali","hi":"त्रुटि","ja":"エラー","ko":"오류","ur":"نقص","vi":"Lỗi sai","km":"កំ​ហុស​"}},"errorMessage":{"value":"<p>Uh oh. Something is not quite right. [error]</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>¡Oh, no! Algo está mal. [error]</p>","zh-hant":"<p>啊。 出錯了。 [error]</p>","tl":"<p>Uh oh. May isang bagay na hindi tama. [error]</p>","hi":"<p>उह ओह। कोई चीज़ ठीक नहीं है। [error]</p>","ja":"<p>何かが間違っているようです。[error]</p>","ko":"<p>다시 시도해주세요. 잘못되었습니다. [error]</p>","ur":"<p>اوہ ہو۔ کچھ ٹھیک نہیں لگتا۔ [error]</p>","vi":"<p>Ồ. Có sai sót gì đó. [error]</p>","km":"<p>អ៊ុ អ៊ូ ។ មាន​អ្វី​មួយ​មិន​ត្រឹម​ត្រូវហើយ​ ។​ [error]</p>"},"tokens":{"error":"Error Message"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"logicSets":[{"breakOnMatch":false,"matchConditions":[{"test":"[voterTypeCode]","operator":"equals","value":"ravbm","join":"or","caseSensitive":false},{"test":"[voterTypeCode]","operator":"equals","value":"uocava","join":"or","caseSensitive":false}],"setTokens":[],"setTracking":[],"setParams":[],"setNext":"eligibility","setPrev":"election-choice"}]},{"id":"access-denied","type":"html","params":{"title":{"value":"Access Denied","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"es":"Acceso denegado"}},"html":{"value":"<p>You are not allowed to access this page.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","translations":{"es":"<p>No tienes permiso para acceder a esta página.</p>"}},"hideActions":true},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"eligibility","type":"checkboxes","params":{"min":1,"max":1,"options":[{"id":"confirm","value":"confirm","label":{"value":"I certify that all of the above are true.","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Certifico que todas las declaraciones anteriores son verdaderas.","zh-hant":"我證明以上資訊皆屬實。","tl":"Pinapatunayan ko na ang lahat ng nasa  itaas ay totoo.","vi":"Tôi xác nhận tất cả chi tiết ở trên là đúng.","section":"CA Eligibility","path":"params - options - 0 - label","km":"ខ្ញុំ​សូម​បញ្ជាក់​ថា ព័ត៌​មាន​ទាំងអស់​​ខាង​លើគឺ​ពិត​ជា​ត្រឺម​ត្រូវ ។​","hi":"मैं प्रमाणित करता/करती हूँ कि ऊपर दिए गए सभी तथ्य सही हैं।","ja":"私は上記のすべてが真実であることを証明します。","ko":"저는 위 사항이 모두 사실임을 확인하는 바입니다."}},"description":{"value":"","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}}}],"title":{"value":"Please confirm your eligibility to access this system.","format":null,"style":null,"translations":{"es":"Por favor confirme su elegibilidad para acceder a este sistema.","zh-hant":"請確認您是否有資格使用此系統。","tl":"Mangyaring patunayan ang iyong pagiging karapat-dapat sa pag-access sa sistemang ito.","vi":"Xin xác nhận là quý vị đủ điều kiện để truy cập vào hệ thống này.","section":"CA Eligibility","path":"params - title","km":"សូម​បញ្ជាក់​ពីសិទ្ធិ​ស្រប​ច្បាប់​របស់​អ្នក​ដើម្បី​អាច​ចូល​​ប្រើ​ប្រាស់​ប្រ​ព័ន្ធ​នេះ​បាន​ ។​","hi":"कृपया इस प्रणाली को ऐक्सेस करने के लिए अपनी पात्रता की \nपुष्टि करें।","ja":"このシステムにアクセスするための資格を確認してください。","ko":"귀하가 이 시스템을 이용할 자격이 있는지 확인해 주십시오."}},"intro":{"value":"<p>For the November 4, 2025, Statewide Special Election, all registered voters in California are eligible to use this accessible vote-by-mail system.</p><p><br></p><ul><li>I am a California registered voter; therefore, I am eligible to use this accessible vote by-mail system.</li><li>I understand that my ballot selections marked by this system must be printed by me and submitted to my county elections official, Fresno County Registrar of Voters no later than 8:00 p.m. Pacific Standard Time on November 4, 2025 - Election Day - by any of the following methods:<ul><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Mailing it with a postmark on or before November 4, 2025; or</li><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Hand delivering it to the office of my county elections official; or</li><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Dropping it off at any polling place, vote center, vote-by-mail drop-off location, or drop box in the state; or</li><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Returning by fax for military (living outside the territorial limits of the United States) and overseas voters (UOCAVA) only.</li></ul></li><li>I understand that my ballot selections marked by this system and submitted to Fresno County Registrar of Voters will be transferred onto a ballot by an election official to be tabulated.</li></ul>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Para las Elecci&oacute;n Especial Estatal del 4 de Noviembre 2025, todos los votantes registrados en California son elegibles para usar este sistema accesible de votaci&oacute;n por correo.</p><ul><li>Soy votante registrado en California; por lo tanto, puedo usar este sistema accesible de voto por correo.</li><li>Entiendo que debo imprimir mis selecciones de papeleta marcadas por este sistema y entregarlas al funcionario electoral de mi condado, el Registro Electoral del Condado de Fresno, a m&aacute;s tardar a las 8:00 p.m., hora est&aacute;ndar del Pac&iacute;fico, del 4 de noviembre de 2025 (d&iacute;a de las elecciones), mediante cualquiera de los siguientes m&eacute;todos:<ul><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Enviarlo por correo con matasellos del 4 de noviembre de 2025 o antes; o</li><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Entregarlo personalmente en la oficina del funcionario electoral de mi condado; o</li><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Entregarlo en cualquier lugar de votaci&oacute;n, centro de votaci&oacute;n, punto de entrega de voto por correo o buz&oacute;n del estado; o</li><li style=\"margin-left: 20px;\">Devolverlo por fax, solo para militares (que viven fuera de los l&iacute;mites territoriales de los Estados Unidos) y votantes en el extranjero (UOCAVA).</li></ul></li><li>Entiendo que mis selecciones de boleta marcadas por este sistema y enviadas al Registrador de Votantes del Condado de Fresno ser&aacute;n transferidas a una boleta por un funcionario electoral para ser tabuladas.</li></ul>","zh-hant":"<p>根據加州法律，只有軍人選民、海外選民和殘疾選民才有資格使用這個無障礙投票系統。</p><ul><li>我是殘疾選民或軍人或海外選民，因此我有資格使用這個無障礙投票系統。</li><li>我瞭解，我的選擇將由本系統標記，並將遞交給我的地方選舉官員，然後轉換成正式選票以供統計。</li><li>我瞭解，我的選擇由本系統標記，但必須由我列印，並遞交給我的地方選舉官員。 郵寄選票的郵戳必須是在 2020年3月3日之前。 未經郵寄的選票必須在太平洋時間 2020年3月3日星期二晚上 8 點之前收到。</li></ul>","tl":"<p>Sa ilalim ng batas ng California, ang mga botanteng nasa militar, mga botanteng nasa ibayong dagat at mga botanteng may mga kapansanan lamang ang karapat-dapat na gumamit ng accessible Vote by Mail na sistemang ito.</p><ul><li>Ako ay alinman sa isang botanteng may kapansanan o isang militar o isang botanteng nasa ibayong dagat, at samakatuwid ako ay karapat-dapat gumamit ng Vote by Mail na sistemang ito.</li><li>Naiintindihan ko na ang aking mga kagustuhang minarkahan ng sistemang ito at isinumite sa aking lokal na opisyal ng halalan ay ililipat pagkatapos sa isang opisyal na balota para sa pagbibilang.</li><li>Naiintindihan kong ang aking mga kagustuhang minarkahan ng sistemang ito ay dapat kong i-print at isumite sa aking lokal na opisyal ng halalan. Ang mga balotang ipinadala sa pamamagitan ng koreo ay dapat may postmarked bago o sa Marso 3, 2020. Ang mga balotang hindi napadala sa pamamagitan ng koreo ay dapat matanggap nang hindi lalampas sa 8 p.m. Pacific Time sa Martes, Marso 3, 2020.</li></ul>","hi":"<p>California कानून के तहत, केवल सेना में मतदाता, विदेशी मतदाता, और विकलांग मतदाता इस डाक द्वारा मतदान करें सुलभ प्रणाली का उपयोग करने के लिए पात्र हैं।</p><ul><li>मैं या तो एक विकलांग या एक सैन्य या विदेशी मतदाता हूँ, और इसलिए मैं इस डाक द्वारा मतदान करें सुलभ प्रणाली का उपयोग करने के लिए पात्र हूँ।</li><li>मैं समझता/समझती हूँ कि इस प्रणाली द्वारा निशान लगाए गए और मेरे स्थानीय चुनाव अधिकारी को भेजे गए मेरे चयन इसके बाद टैबुलेशन के लिए एक आधिकारिक मतपत्र पर स्थानांतरित किए जाएंगे।</li><li>मैं समझता/समझती हूँ कि इस प्रणाली द्वारा निशान लगाए गए मेरे चयनों को मेरे द्वारा प्रिंट किया जाना और मेरे स्थानीय चुनाव अधिकारी को भेजा जाना ज़रूरी है। जिन मतपत्रों को डाक द्वारा भेजा जाता है उन्हें 3 मार्च, 2020 तक अवश्य पोस्टमार्क किया जाना चाहिए। ऐसे मतपत्र जिन्हें डाक द्वारा नहीं भेजा जाता है, वे 3 मार्च, 2020 पर रात 8 बजे, पेसिफिक समय से पहले अवश्य प्राप्त हो जाने चाहिए।</li></ul>","ja":"<p>California州法では、軍隊、海外の有権者、および障害を持つ有権者のみが、このバリアフリー郵便投票システムを使用する資格があります。</p><ul><li>私は、障害者または軍隊または海外の有権者のあり、したがって、私は、このバリアフリー郵便投票システムを使用する資格があります。</li><li>私は、このシステムによって印をつけ、地方選挙担当官に提出された自分の選択内容が、その後、集計のための公式投票用紙に移されることを理解しています。</li><li>私は、このシステムによって印をつけた自分の選択内容を、私が印刷し、地方選挙担当官に提出しなければならないということを理解しています。郵送される投票用紙には、2020年3月3日までの消印が必要です。郵送によらない投票用紙は、2020年3月3日の太平洋標準時間午後8時までに受け取られなければなりません。</li></ul>","ko":"<p>California 주법에 따라, 군인, 해외 거주 유권자, 그리고 장애인 유권자만 우편 투표 시스템을 이용할 수 있습니다.</p><ul><li>저는 장애인, 군인 또는 해외 거주 유권자이므로 우편 투표 시스템을 이용할 자격이 있습니다.</li><li>저는 이 시스템에 표시되며 담당 지역 선거 공무원에게 제출한 저의 선택 항목이 공식 투표 정보로 전달 및 정리될 것을 알고 있습니다.</li><li>저는 이 시스템에 표시된 저의 선택 항목을 직접 출력하여 담당 지역 선거 공무원에게 제출해야 함을 알고 있습니다. 우편 투표지는 2020 년 3 월 3 일까지의 소인이 찍혀야 합니다. 우편 발송을 하지 않은 투표지는 2020 년 3 월 3 일의 태평양 표준시 오후 8시까지 접수되어야 합니다.</li></ul>","vi":"<p>Theo luật tiểu bang California, chỉ c&oacute; c&aacute;c cử tri trong qu&acirc;n đội, cử tri ở nước ngo&agrave;i v&agrave; cử tri khuyết tật mới được sử dụng hệ thống Bỏ phiếu Bằng Thư dễ tiếp cận n&agrave;y.</p><ul><li>T&ocirc;i l&agrave; cử tri khuyết tật hoặc một cử tri qu&acirc;n nh&acirc;n hoặc cử tri ở nước ngo&agrave;i, v&agrave; do đ&oacute; t&ocirc;i hội đủ điều kiện sử dụng hệ thống Bầu Bằng Thư dễ tiếp cận n&agrave;y.</li><li>T&ocirc;i hiểu rằng những lựa chọn của t&ocirc;i được đ&aacute;nh dấu bởi hệ thống n&agrave;y v&agrave; nộp cho vi&ecirc;n chức bầu cử địa phương của t&ocirc;i rồi sẽ được chuyển sang l&aacute; phiếu ch&iacute;nh thức để được đếm.</li><li>T&ocirc;i hiểu rằng những lựa chọn của t&ocirc;i được đ&aacute;nh dấu bởi hệ thống n&agrave;y sẽ được t&ocirc;i in ra v&agrave; nộp cho vi&ecirc;n chức bầu cử địa phương của t&ocirc;i. C&aacute;c l&aacute; phiếu m&agrave; được gửi bằng thư phải c&oacute; dấu bưu ch&iacute;nh kh&ocirc;ng qu&aacute; Ng&agrave;y 3 th&aacute;ng 3 năm 2020. C&aacute;c l&aacute; phiếu kh&ocirc;ng được gửi qua đường bưu điện phải được nhận trước 8 giờ tối Giờ Th&aacute;i B&igrave;nh Dương v&agrave;o Thứ Ba, Ng&agrave;y 3 th&aacute;ng 3 năm 2020.</li></ul>","km":"<p>ស្ថិតក្រោមច្បាប់រដ្ឋ California មានតែអ្នកបោះឆ្នោតជាយោធិន ជាអ្នកបោះឆ្នោតស្ថិតនៅក្រៅប្រទេស និងអ្នកបោះឆ្នោតដែលមានពិការភាពទេ ដែលមាសិទ្ធិប្រើប្រាស់ប្រព័ន្ធបោះឆ្នោតតាមសំបុត្របាន ។</p><ul><li>ខ្ញុំជាអ្នកបោះឆ្នោតទាំងជាយោធិនដែលមានពិការភាព និងជាអ្នកបោះឆ្នោតស្ថិតនៅក្រៅប្រទេស ដូច្នេះហើយ ខ្ញុំមានសិទ្ធិប្រើប្រាស់ប្រព័ន្ធបោះឆ្នោតតាមសំបុត្របាន ។</li><li>ខ្ញុំយល់ហើយថាការជ្រើសរើសរបស់ខ្ញុំត្រូវបានគូសដោយប្រព័ន្ធនេះ និងបានដាក់បញ្ជូនទៅកាន់មន្ត្រីរៀបចំការបោះឆ្នោតក្នុងមូលដ្ឋានរបស់ខ្ញុំ ដែលបន្ទាប់មកនឹងត្រូវបញ្ជូនបន្តដាក់ចូលទៅក្នុងសន្លឹកឆ្នោតផ្លូវការដើម្បីរៀបចំជាបញ្ជីបោះឆ្នោត ។</li><li>ខ្ញុំយល់ហើយថាការជ្រើសរើសរបស់ខ្ញុំត្រូវបានគូសដោយប្រព័ន្ធនេះ ត្រូវតែព្រីនចេញដោយខ្ញុំផ្ទាល់ និងត្រូវបានដាក់បញ្ជូនទៅកាន់មន្ត្រីរៀបចំការបោះឆ្នោតក្នុងមូលដ្ឋានរបស់ខ្ញុំ ។ សន្លឹកឆ្នោតដែលត្រូវផ្ញើតាមសំបុត្រត្រូវតែមានវាយត្រាដោយ ថ្ងៃទី ៣ ខែមីនាឆ្នាំ ២០២០ ។ សន្លឹកឆ្នោតដែលមិនត្រូវផ្ញើមក ត្រូវតែទទួលដោយមិនត្រូវយឺតជាងម៉ោង 8 យប់ ម៉ោងប៉ាស៊ីភិចនៅលើ ថ្ងៃទី ៣ ខែមីនាឆ្នាំ ២០២០ ។</li></ul>"}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"logicSets":[],"prev":"election"},{"id":"style","type":"style-select","ui":[],"params":{"aid":"[aid]","eid":"{eid}","partyMapping":false,"ignoreLeadingZeros":true,"title":{"value":"Select a Ballot","translations":{"es":"Seleccione una boleta","zh-hant":"選擇一張選票","tl":"Pumili ng isang Balota","hi":"मतपत्र चुनें","ja":"投票用紙の選択","ko":"투표용지를 선택하십시오.","ur":"ایک بیلٹ منتخب کریں","vi":"Chọn một Lá Phiếu"}},"instructions":{"value":"<p>You are not registered with a qualified political party. For the March 5, 2024, Presidential Primary Election, you are allowed to vote in one of the following party&rsquo;s ballots this election. Select which party&#39;s ballot you would like to vote.</p><p>To vote in the Presidential Primary for the Republican, Green, or Peace and Freedom parties, you must re-register to vote with that party.&nbsp;</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>No est&aacute; registrado en un partido pol&iacute;tico calificado. Para la Elecci&oacute;n Primaria Presidencial del 5 de marzo de 2024, se le permite votar en una de las boletas del siguiente partido en esta elecci&oacute;n. Seleccione la boleta del partido que le gustar&iacute;a votar.</p><p>&nbsp;Para votar en las primarias presidenciales de los partidos Republicano, Verde o Paz y Libertad, debe volver a registrarse para votar con ese partido.</p>"}},"searchingForBallot":{"value":"<p>Searching for ballot...</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Buscando la boleta...</p>","zh-hant":"<p>尋找選票...... </p>","tl":"<p>Naghahanap ng balota...</p>","hi":"<p>मतपत्र की खोज हो रही है...</p>","ja":"<p>投票用紙を探しています...</p>","ko":"<p>투표 용지 검색 중...</p>","ur":"<p>بیلٹ کی تلاش کی جا رہی ہے۔۔۔</p>","vi":"<p>Tìm lá phiếu...</p>"}},"ballotOption":{"value":"[party]","translations":{"es":"Estilo de boleta [party]","zh-hant":"選票樣式 [party]","tl":"Uri ng Balota [party]","hi":"मतपत्र शैली [party]","ja":"投票用紙の形式 [party]","ko":"투표 용지 형태 [party]","ur":"بیلٹ سٹائل [party]","vi":"Kiểu Lá Phiếu [party]"},"tokens":{"code":"Style Code","name":"Style Name","party":"Party Name","party_code":"Party Code"}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"No ballot found","translations":{"es":"No se encontró la boleta","zh-hant":"沒有發現投票","tl":"Walang nahanap na balota","hi":"कोई मतपत्र नहीं मिला","ja":"投票用紙が見つかりません","ko":"투표 용지를 찾지 못 했습니다.","ur":"کوئی بیلٹ نہیں ملا","vi":"Không có lá phiếu nào được tìm thấy"}},"notFoundMessage":{"value":"<p>We were unable to locate a ballot for you this election. If you feel this is an error, please contact your local elections office.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>No podemos encontrar una boleta para usted en esta elección. Si cree que esto es un error, comuníquese con su funcionario electoral local.</p>","zh-hant":"<p>我們無法找到您這次選舉的投票。 如果您覺得這是一個錯誤，請聯絡您當地的選舉辦公室。</p>","tl":"<p>Hindi namin mahanap ang balota para sa iyo sa halalan na ito. Kung sa tingin mo ito ay isang pagkakamali, mangyaring makipag-ugnay sa iyong lokal na opisina ng halalan.</p>","hi":"<p>हम इस चुनाव में आपके लिए एक मतपत्र का पता लगाने में असमर्थ रहे। यदि आपको लगता है कि यह कोई ग़लती है, तो कृपया अपने स्थानीय चुनाव कार्यालय से संपर्क करें।</p>","ja":"<p>この選挙のあなたの投票用紙は見つかりませんでした。これが誤りであると思われる場合は、地方選挙事務所にご連絡ください。</p>","ko":"<p>이번 선거에서 귀하가 사용하실 투표지를 찾을 수 없습니다. 오류라고 생각되면 지역 선거 사무소에 문의하시기 바랍니다.</p>","ur":"<p>ہم اس الیکشن میں آپ کے لیے کوئی بیلٹ ڈھونڈنے سے قاصر ہیں۔ اگر آپ کو لگے کہ ایسا غلطی سے ہوا ہے تو براہ کرم اپنے مقامی الیکشن دفتر سے رابطہ کریں۔</p>","vi":"<p>Chúng tôi không tìm được lá phiếu cho quý vị trong cuộc bầu cử này. Nếu quý vị cảm thấy đây là lỗi sai, hãy liên hệ với văn phòng bầu cử địa phương của quý vị.</p>","km":"<p>យើង​មិន​អាច​រក​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​សម្រាប់​ការ​ជ្រើស​រើស​របស់​អ្នក​ឃើញ​ទេ​ ។​ ប្រ​សិន​បើ​អ្នក​​យល់​ថា​នេះ​ជា​កំ​ហុសនោះ សូម​ទាក់​ទង​ការិយាល័យ​បោះ​ឆ្នោត​ក្នុង​មូល​ដ្ឋាន​របស់​អ្នក ។​</p>"}},"errorTitle":{"value":"Error","translations":{"es":"Error","zh-hant":"錯誤","tl":"Mali","hi":"गड़बड़ी","ja":"エラー","ko":"오류","ur":"نقص","vi":"Lỗi sai","km":"កំ​ហុស​"}},"errorMessage":{"value":"<p>Uh oh. Something is not quite right. [error]</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>¡Oh, no! Algo está mal. [error]</p>","zh-hant":"<p>啊。 出錯了。 [error]</p>","tl":"<p>Uh oh. May isang bagay na hindi tama. [error]</p>","hi":"<p>उह ओह। कुछ बिलकुल सही नहीं है। [गड़बड़ी]</p>","ja":"<p>あれっ。何かが間違っているようです。[エラー]</p>","ko":"<p>죄송합니다. 문제가 발생했습니다. [error]</p>","ur":"<p>اوہ ہو۔ کچھ ٹھیک نہیں لگتا۔ [error]</p>","vi":"<p>Ồ. Có sai sót gì đó. [error]</p>","km":"<p>អ៊ុ អ៊ូ ។ មាន​អ្វី​មួយ​មិន​ត្រឹម​ត្រូវហើយ​ ។​ [error]</p>"},"tokens":{"error":"Error Message"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"package-builder","type":"package-builder","basePath":"package","params":{"aid":"[aid]","eid":"{eid}","overlays":{"Voter ID":"[vr:vid]","Voter Precinct":"[vr:pid]","First Name":"[vr:fname]","Last Name":"[vr:lname]","Date of Birth":"[vr:dob]","Resident Adddress":"[vr:raddress1] [vr:rcity] [vr:rstate] [vr:rzip]"},"showSessionWarning":false,"packageCode":"[voterTypeCode]-[packageContext]","packageAid":"[aid]","packageEid":"{eid}","label":{"value":"Download Return Package","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Descargar paquete de devolución","zh-hant":"下載交回郵件包","tl":"I-DOWNLOAD ANG PAKETENG PAMBALIK","vi":"TẢI XUỐNG BƯU KIỆN GỮI TRẢ LẠI","ja":"提出用パッケージのダウンロード","ko":"반송 패키지 다운로드","hi":"वापसी पैकेज डाउनलोड करें","ur":"","km":"ទាញយកកញ្ចប់​​ដែល​​ត្រូវ​បញ្ចូន​ត្រ​ឡប់​មក​វិញ​"}},"title":{"value":"Ballot Return Package","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Paquete de Devolución de Boletas","zh-hant":"選票交回郵件包","tl":"Paketeng Pambalik ng Balota","vi":"Bưu Kiện Lá Phiếu Gửi Trả Lại","ja":"投票用紙提出用パッケージ","ko":"투표지 반송 패키지","hi":"मतपत्र वापसी पैकेज","ur":"","km":"កញ្ចប់​​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​ត្រូវ​បញ្ចូន​ត្រ​ឡប់​មក​វិញ​"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>Please click the link below to start your download.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Por favor, haga clic en el enlace de abajo para empezar su descarga.","zh-hant":"請點擊下面的鏈接進行下載。","tl":"Paki-click ang link sa ibaba para simulan ang iyong download.","vi":"<p>Vui lòng nhấn đường link dưới đây để quý vị bắt đầu tải xuống.</p>","ja":"<p>下のリンクをクリックして、ダウンロードを開始してください。</p>","ko":"<p>아래 링크를 클릭하여 다운로드하십시오.</p>","hi":"<p>कृपया अपना डाउनलोड शुरू करने के लिए नीचे दिए लिंक पर क्लिक करें।</p>","ur":"","km":"<p>សូម​ចុច​លើ​តំ​ណ​ភ្ជាប់​ខាង​ក្រោម​ដើម្បី​ចាប់​ផ្តើម​ការ​ទាញ​យក​ឯកសារ​របស់​អ្នក​ ។​</p>"}},"downloadButton":{"value":"Download Return Package","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Descargar paquete de devolución","zh-hant":"下載交回郵件包","tl":"I-DOWNLOAD ANG PAKETENG PAMBALIK","vi":"TẢI XUỐNG BƯU KIỆN GỮI TRẢ LẠI","ja":"提出用パッケージのダウンロード","ko":"반송 패키지 다운로드","hi":"वापसी पैकेज डाउनलोड करें","ur":"","km":"ទាញយកកញ្ចប់​​ដែល​​ត្រូវ​បញ្ចូន​ត្រ​ឡប់​មក​វិញ​"}},"building":{"value":"Building Return Package...","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Paquete de devolución del edificio...","zh-hant":"建築回歸套餐...","tl":"","vi":"","ja":"提出用パッケージの準備中...","ko":"반송 패키지를 구성하는 중입니다...","hi":"वापसी पैकेज बनाना...","ur":"","km":"ការ​បង្កើត​​កញ្ចប់ផ្ញើ​​ត្រឡ​ប់​មក​វិញ...​"}},"error":{"value":"There was an error building your ballot return package. Click on the following link to try again.","translations":{"needed":"noi18n","es":"Se produjo un error al generar su paquete de devolución de papeletas. Haga clic en el siguiente enlace para volver a intentarlo.","zh-hant":"建立您的選票返回包時出錯。單擊以下鏈接再試一次。","tl":"","vi":"","ja":"投票用紙提出用パッケージの準備中にエラーが発生しました。次のリンクをクリックして、もう一度やり直してください。","ko":"투표지 반송 패키지 구성 중 오류가 발생했습니다. 다음 링크를 클릭하여 다시 시도하십시오.","hi":"आपके मतपत्र वापसी पैकेज को बनाने में कोई गड़बड़ी हुई थी। दोबारा कोशिश करने के लिए निम्न लिंक पर क्लिक करें।","ur":"","km":"មាន​កំ​ហុស​នៅ​ក្នុង​ការ​បង្កើត​កញ្ចប់​​ផ្ញើ​ត្រឡប់​សន្លឹក​ឆ្នោត​របស់​អ្នក​។​ សូម​ចុច​លើ​តំ​ណ​ភ្ជាប់​ខាង​​ក្រោម​ដើម្បី​សាក​ល្បង​ជា​ថ្មី ។"}},"pageTitle":{"value":"Ballot Return Package","translations":{"es":"Paquete de devolución de boletas"}},"pageIntro":{"value":"<p>Please click the link below to start your download.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"Por favor, haga clic en el enlace de abajo para empezar su descarga."}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"secure-select","type":"website","params":{"url":"https://ss.omniballot.us","urlParams":{"data":"https://api.omniballot.us/v7/public/styletosecureselect?pid=[vr:pid]&data=[style:json_uri]","lang":"[lang]"},"target":"new"},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"end-session","type":"end-session","ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false}]},{"id":"statement","type":"workflow","tracking":{"context":"statement"},"apps":[{"id":"reset-session-logic","type":"logic","next":"election-choice","hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":true,"ui":[]},{"id":"election-choice","type":"radios","params":{"required":true,"options":[{"id":"1710","value":"1710","label":{"value":"November 4, 2025 Statewide Special Election","format":"style","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Elección Especial Municipal del 18 de marzo de 2025"}},"description":{"value":"","format":"style","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":""}}}],"title":{"value":"Select an Election","format":"style","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Seleccione una elección"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>Please select the election you wish to fix a challenge to your ballot for.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Seleccione la elecci&oacute;n para la que desea corregir una impugnaci&oacute;n de su boleta.</p>"}}},"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"ui":[],"logicSets":[]},{"id":"database-logic","type":"logic","logicSets":[{"breakOnMatch":false,"matchConditions":[{"test":"[election-choice:value]","operator":"equals","value":"1710","join":"","caseSensitive":false}],"setTokens":[{"name":"vrDb","value":"1044","operators":[]}],"setTracking":[],"setParams":[]}],"prev":"election-choice","next":"vr","hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"ui":[]},{"id":"vr","type":"vr","isAdvanced":false,"params":{"aid":"06019","vrAid":"06019","db":"{vrDb}","validationCodes":"lookup","onFound":"form","onNotFound":"not-found","onFoundMultiple":"form","lookupFields":[{"label":"UI_FIRST_NAME","name":"fname","autocomplete":"given-name","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","operator":"equals (default), startswith, matches, hasword, wildcard"},{"label":"UI_LAST_NAME","name":"lname","autocomplete":"family-name","error":{"value":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","format":"style","style":"default","translations":{},"audio":{}},"type":"text","options":[]},{"label":"UI_DOB","name":"dob","autocomplete":"bday","type":"date","options":[],"range":"2015-1900"}],"hiddenFields":[],"sampleVoters":[{"vid":"sample_1","fname":"sample","lname":"voter","bday":"1999-01-01","party_code":"NON","validationCode":"lookup","data1":"No Sig Match","pid":"0000001"},{"vid":"sample_1","fname":"unsigned","lname":"voter","bday":"1999-01-01","party_code":"NON","validationCode":"lookup","data1":"No Signature","pid":"0000001"},{"vid":"sample_1","fname":"verification","lname":"voter","bday":"1999-01-01","party_code":"NON","validationCode":"lookup","data1":"No Sig Match","pid":"0000001"}],"lookupTitle":{"value":"Voter Lookup","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Búsqueda del votante"}},"lookupIntro":{"value":"<p>Please complete the following fields. All fields are required:</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Por favor complete los siguientes campos. Todos los campos son obligatorios:</p>"}},"confirmTitle":{"value":"Voter Information Found","translations":{"es":"Se encontró la información del votante"}},"confirmIntro":{"value":"<p>Please select your information from the list below.</p>","format":"html","translations":{"es":"<p>Seleccione su información de la siguiente lista.</p>"}},"confirmNotFound":{"value":"I don't see my information above.","translations":{"es":"No veo mi información en la lista anterior."}},"notFoundTitle":{"value":"Voter information not found","translations":{"es":"No se encontró la información del votante"}},"notFoundIntro":{"value":"<p>We were unable to find your information in our database. Please verify the information you entered is the same information you used to register to vote. Please contact your local elections office if you need assistance.</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":""}},"notFoundStartOver":{"value":"Click here to try again","translations":{"es":"Haga clic aquí para volver a intentarlo"}}},"ui":[],"allowFirst":true,"resetSession":false,"hideContinueButton":false,"logicSets":[{"breakOnMatch":false,"matchConditions":[{"test":"","operator":"equals","value":"","join":"","caseSensitive":false}],"setTokens":[{"name":"voterTypeCode","value":"default","operators":[]},{"name":"lookupPid","value":"[vr:pid]","operators":[]}],"setTracking":[],"setParams":[]}]},{"id":"not-found","type":"html","params":{"title":{"value":"No Match Found","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{}},"html":{"value":"<p>We were unable to match the information you entered to a voter registration record.</p><p>If you believe that the information you entered is correct, please contact your county board of elections.</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":""}},"hideActions":true},"logicSets":[],"ui":[],"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"hideContinueButton":false},{"id":"no-challenge","type":"end-session","hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"ui":[],"params":{"title":{"value":"No Challenge on Record","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"No hay ningún desafío registrado"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>There is currently no challenge to your ballot submission on record.</p><p>If you believe this is in error, please <a href=\"http://www.co.fresno.ca.us/departments/county-clerk-registrar-of-voters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">contact</a> your local elections office.</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Actualmente no hay ninguna impugnaci&oacute;n registrada sobre el env&iacute;o de su boleta.</p><p>Si cree que esto es un error, <a href=\"http://www.co.fresno.ca.us/departments/county-clerk-registrar-of-voters\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">comun&iacute;quese</a> con su oficina electoral local.</p>"}}}},{"id":"type","type":"cta","params":{"actions":[{"title":{"value":"Unsigned Ballot Statement","format":"text","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Declaración De Boleta Electoral Sin Firmar"}},"description":{"value":"<p>I have been notified that I did not sign my VBM identification envelope.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Se me notific&oacute; que no he firmado el sobre de identificaci&oacute;n de mi voto por correo (Vote-by-Mail, VBM).</p>"}},"button":{"value":"CONTINUE","translations":{"es":"CONTINUAR"}},"external":false,"page":"statement/unsigned","value":"unsigned","track":"unsigned","hide":false},{"title":{"value":"Signature Verification Statement","format":"text","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Declaración de verificación de firma"}},"description":{"value":"<p>I have been notified that my signature on my VBM identification envelope does not match my signatures on record.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Se me notific&oacute; que la firma que coloqu&eacute; en mi sobre de identificaci&oacute;n de VBM no coincide con mis firmas registradas.</p>"}},"button":{"value":"CONTINUE","translations":{"es":"CONTINUAR"}},"external":false,"page":"statement/verification","value":"verification","track":"verification","hide":false}],"title":{"value":"How was your vote-by-mail ballot challenged?","format":"text","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"¿Cómo se impugnó su boleta de voto por correo?"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>You received a notice that your signature was missing or doesn&rsquo;t match the signature on record. Please select the form needed to cure the challenge. If you did not receive a notification indicating a challenge to your ballot, please return to the home page and select another option.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Recibi&oacute; un aviso que indica que falta su firma o que no coincide con la firma registrada. Seleccione el formulario necesario para resolver la impugnaci&oacute;n. Si no recibi&oacute; ninguna notificaci&oacute;n donde se indique que se impugn&oacute; su boleta electoral, vuelva a la p&aacute;gina de inicio y seleccione otra opci&oacute;n.</p>"}}},"prev":"vr","hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"ui":[],"logicSets":[{"breakOnMatch":false,"matchConditions":[{"test":"","operator":"equals","value":"","join":"","caseSensitive":false}],"setTokens":[{"name":"precinctId","value":"[vr:pid]","operators":[]}],"setTracking":[],"setParams":[]}]},{"id":"form","type":"form","prev":"vr","next":"statement-review","logicSets":[{"breakOnMatch":false,"matchConditions":[{"test":"","operator":"equals","value":"","join":"","caseSensitive":false}],"setTokens":[{"name":"statement-type","value":"unsigned","operators":[]}],"setTracking":[],"setParams":[],"setNext":"statement-review","setPrev":"vr"}],"params":{"fields":[{"type":"fieldset","name":"statement","label":{"value":"CHALLENGED VERIFICATION STATEMENT","translations":{"es":"DECLARACIÓN DE VERIFICACIÓN DESAFIADA"}},"children":[{"type":"row","name":"voter-info","grid":"1fr","children":[{"label":{"value":"YOUR NAME","translations":{"es":"SU NOMBRE"}},"description":{"value":"(please print your full name as registered to vote)","translations":{"es":"(favor de escribir en letra de molde su nombre completo, como se registró para votar)"}},"name":"name","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","maxLength":100}]},{"type":"row","label":{"value":"ADDRESS:","translations":{"es":"DIRECCIÓN:"}},"description":{"value":"","translations":{"es":""}},"style":{"padding-top":".5rem"},"name":"voter-residential","grid":"4fr 1fr 2fr 2fr","children":[{"label":{"value":"Street Address","translations":{"es":"CALLE"}},"name":"raddress1","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","optional":false},{"label":{"value":"Unit/Apt#","translations":{"es":"N.º DE UNIDAD/DEPARTAMENTO"}},"name":"raddress2","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","optional":true},{"label":{"value":"City","translations":{"es":"CIUDAD"}},"name":"city","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","optional":false},{"label":{"value":"Zip Code","translations":{"es":"CÓDIGO POSTAL"}},"name":"zip","error":"Invalid Zip Code. 5 digit Zip Code required.","type":"text","maxLength":5,"minLength":5,"pattern":"\\d+","optional":false}]}]}],"fullWidth":true,"title":{"value":"CHALLENGED VERIFICATION STATEMENT","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"DECLARACIÓN DE VERIFICACIÓN DESAFIADA"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>Dear Voter,</p><p>We received your Vote-by-Mail Ballot or Provisional Ballot. Unfortunately, your Vote-by-Mail Ballot is in a challenged state due to either the Vote-by-Mail return envelope was not signed, or we have determined that the signature you provided on your Vote-by-Mail Ballot or Provisional Ballot does not compare to the signature(s) on file in your voter record. Failure to follow these instructions may cause your Vote-by-Mail ballot not to count. Please note that the signature provided on the completed statement may be added to your voter record to be used for signature comparison purposes in future elections.</p><p>Complete and sign the Challenged Verification Statement below, then choose one of the following return options:</p><ul><li>Mail or hand deliver to the Elections Office at 2221 Kern Street, Fresno, CA 93721. You may use the enclosed postage-paid envelope or your own envelope with sufficient postage.</li><li>Email to the Elections Office at <a href=\"mailto:clerk-elections@fresnocountyca.gov\">clerk-elections@fresnocountyca.gov</a>.</li><li>Fax to the Elections Office at (559) 488-3279.</li><li>Hand-deliver to any open Vote Center or Official Drop Box within Fresno County before 8:00 p.m. on Election Day.</li><li>To access and submit your official Challenged Ballot Statement electronically, enter the following address (<a href=\"https://sites.omniballot.us/06019/app/home\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://sites.omniballot.us/06019/app/home</a>) in the address bar and follow the instructions.</li></ul><p><br></p><p>Return your completed statement as soon as possible. It must be received no later than <strong>5 P.M. November 30, 2025</strong>, two days prior to certification of the election.</p><p><br></p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Your signature on this form must compare to your signature in your voter record.</strong></p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Estimado votante,</p><p>Recibimos su boleta de Voto por Correo o boleta provisional. Desafortunadamente, su boleta de Voto por Correo se encuentra en un estado cuestionado debido a que el sobre de devoluci&oacute;n de Voto por Correo no estaba firmado o hemos determinado que la firma que proporcion&oacute; en su boleta de voto por correo o boleta provisional no comparar con las firmas registradas en su registro de votante. No seguir estas instrucciones puede hacer que su boleta de Voto por Correo no cuente. Tenga en cuenta que la firma proporcionada en la declaraci&oacute;n completa puede agregarse a su registro de votante para utilizarla con fines de comparaci&oacute;n de firmas en elecciones futuras.</p><p>Complete y firme la Declaraci&oacute;n de Voto por Correo Desafiada que aparece a continuaci&oacute;n, elija una de las siguientes opciones de devoluci&oacute;n:</p><ul><li>Env&iacute;e por correo o entregue personalmente en la Oficina de Elecciones en 2221 Kern Street, Fresno, CA 93721. Puede utilizar el sobre con franqueo pagado adjunto o su propio sobre con franqueo suficiente.</li><li>Env&iacute;e un correo electr&oacute;nico a la Oficina de Elecciones a <a href=\"mailto:clerk-elections@fresnocountyca.gov\">clerk-elections@fresnocountyca.gov</a>.</li><li>Env&iacute;e por fax a la Oficina de Elecciones al (559) 488-3279.</li><li>Entrega en mano en cualquier centro de votaci&oacute;n abierto o buz&oacute;n oficial dentro del Condado de Fresno antes de las 8:00 p. m. el D&iacute;a de las Elecciones.</li><li>Para acceder y enviar electr&oacute;nicamente su Declaraci&oacute;n de Verificaci&oacute;n Desafiada, ingrese la siguiente direcci&oacute;n (<a href=\"https://sites.omniballot.us/06019/app/home\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><u>https://sites.omniballot.us/06019/app/home</u></a>) en la barra de direcciones y siga las instrucciones.</li></ul><p>Devuelva su estado de cuenta completo lo antes posible. Debe recibirse a m&aacute;s tardar a las 5 p.m., <strong>30 de noviembre de 2025</strong>, dos d&iacute;as antes de la certificaci&oacute;n de la elecci&oacute;n.</p><p style=\"text-align: center;\"><strong>Su firma en este formulario debe compararse con su firma en su registro de votante.</strong></p>"}}},"ui":[],"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"hideContinueButton":false},{"id":"statement-review","type":"form-data-review","prev":"form","next":"signature","logicSets":[{"breakOnMatch":false,"matchConditions":[],"setTokens":[{"name":"formId","value":"1","operators":[]},{"name":"formPackage","value":"unsigned","operators":[]},{"name":"name","value":"[form:name]","operators":[]},{"name":"raddress1","value":"[form:raddress1]","operators":[]},{"name":"raddress2","value":"[form:raddress2]","operators":[]},{"name":"city","value":"[form:city]","operators":[]},{"name":"zip","value":"[form:zip]","operators":[]}],"setTracking":[],"setParams":[],"setNext":"signature","setPrev":"form"}],"params":{"sections":[{"fields":[{"type":"fieldset","name":"statement","label":"CHALLENGED VERIFICATION STATEMENT","children":[{"type":"row","name":"voter-info","grid":"1fr","children":[{"label":"YOUR NAME","description":"(please print your full name as registered to vote)","name":"name","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","maxLength":100}]},{"type":"row","label":"ADDRESS:","style":{"padding-top":".5rem"},"name":"voter-residential","grid":"4fr 1fr 2fr 2fr","children":[{"label":"Street Address","name":"raddress1","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","optional":false},{"label":"Unit/Apt#","name":"raddress2","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","optional":true},{"label":"City","name":"city","error":"UI_FIELD_REQUIRED","type":"text","optional":false},{"label":"Zip Code","name":"zip","error":"Invalid Zip Code. 5 digit Zip Code required.","type":"text","maxLength":5,"minLength":5,"pattern":"\\d+","optional":false}]}]}],"id":"form"}],"continue":{"value":"CONTINUE","translations":{"es":"CONTINUAR"}},"title":{"value":"Review Your Statement","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Revisar su declaración"}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"signature","type":"signature","next":"statement-build","logicSets":[],"params":{"hideWarning":true,"require":true,"canType":false,"canSign":true,"title":{"value":"Voter Signature","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Firma del votante"}},"intro":{"value":"<p>I [name], am a registered voter of FRESNO County, State of California. I declare under penalty of perjury that I requested (or I received) and returned a vote by mail ballot. I am a resident of the precinct in which I have voted, and I am the person whose name appears on the vote by mail ballot envelope. I understand that if I commit or attempt any fraud in connection with voting, or if I aid or abet fraud or attempt to aid or abet fraud in connection with voting, I may be convicted of a felony punishable by imprisonment for 16 months or two or three years. I understand that my failure to sign this statement means that my vote by mail ballot will be invalidated.</p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p>Yo <span style=\"color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Arial, STXihei, 华文细黑, sans-serif; font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; font-variant-ligatures: normal; font-variant-caps: normal; font-weight: 400; letter-spacing: normal; orphans: 2; text-align: start; text-indent: 0px; text-transform: none; widows: 2; word-spacing: 0px; -webkit-text-stroke-width: 0px; white-space: normal; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); text-decoration-thickness: initial; text-decoration-style: initial; text-decoration-color: initial; display: inline !important; float: none;\">[name]</span> , soy votante registrado del Condado de FRESNO, Estado de California. Declaro bajo pena de perjurio que solicit&eacute; (o recibi) y devolv&iacute; un voto por correo y que no he votado ni votar&eacute; m&aacute;s de una boleta en esta elecci&oacute;n. Soy residente del recinto en el que he votado y soy la persona cuyo nombre aparece en el sobre de la boleta de votaci&oacute;n por correo. Entiendo que si cometo o intento cometer alg&uacute;n fraude en relaci&oacute;n con la votaci&oacute;n, o si ayudo o instigo el fraude o instigar el fraude en relaci&oacute;n con la votaci&oacute;n, puedo ser condenado por un delito punible con prisi&oacute;n de 16 meses o dos o tres a&ntilde;os. Entiendo que si no firmo esta declaraci&oacute;n, se invalidar&aacute; mi boleta de voto por correo.</p>"}},"warning":{"value":"<p><strong>It is important this signature matches with the signature used to register to vote.</strong></p>","format":"html","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","ko":"","pa":"","ru":""}},"rotate":{"value":"Please rotate your device for a full screen signature pad."},"rotateNo":{"value":"No Thanks.","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"","zh-hant":"","ko":"","pa":"","ru":""}},"done":{"value":"Done","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"LISTO","zh-hant":"完成","ko":"완료","pa":"ਹੋ ਗਿਆ","ru":"ГОТОВО"}},"cancel":{"value":"Cancel","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"CANCELAR","zh-hant":"取消","ko":"취소","pa":"ਰੱਦ ਕਰੋ","ru":"ОТМЕНА"}},"reset":{"value":"Reset","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"RESTABLECER","zh-hant":"重設","ko":"초기화","pa":"ਮੁੜ ਤੋਂ ਸੈਟ ਕਰੋ","ru":"СБРОС"}},"change":{"value":"Click to Change Signature","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"HAGA CLIC PARA CAMBIAR LA FIRMA","zh-hant":"按一下即可變更簽名","ko":"서명 변경","pa":"ਦਸਤਖ਼ਤ ਬਦਲਣ ਲਈ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ","ru":"НАЖМИТЕ, ЧТОБЫ ИЗМЕНИТЬ ПОДПИСЬ"}},"add":{"value":"Click to Sign (please sign above the line)","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"HAGA CLIC PARA FIRMAR (FIRME SOBRE LA LÍNEA)","zh-hant":"按一下即可簽名（請簽在橫線上方）","ko":"클릭해 서명(줄 위에 서명하십시오)","pa":"ਦਸਤਖ਼ਤ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ (ਕਿਰਪਾ ਕਰਕੇ ਲਾਈਨ ਦੇ ਉੱਪਰ ਦਸਤਖ਼ਤ ਕਰੋ)","ru":"НАЖМИТЕ, ЧТОБЫ ПОДПИСАТЬ (ПОСТАВЬТЕ ПОДПИСЬ НАД ЛИНИЕЙ)."}},"changeMobile":{"value":"Tap to Change Signature (please sign above the line)","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{}},"addMobile":{"value":"Tap to Sign (please sign above the line)","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{}},"textOrSignPlaceholder":{"value":"Sign above or type your name here"},"textPlaceholder":{"value":"Type your name here"}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"prev":"type"},{"id":"statement-build","type":"form-build","logicSets":[],"params":{"aid":"06019","eid":1704,"vid":"[vr:vid]","fname":"[vr:fname]","lname":"[vr:lname]","signature":"[signature:value]","packageAid":"06019","packageEid":1704,"packageCode":"cure","overlays":{"submitDate":"[submitDate]","vid":"[vr:vid]"},"signature2":"[signature2:value]","showPreview":"inline","formId":3,"data":{"voterId":"[vr:vid]","name":"[name]","submissionTimestamp":"","raddress1":"[raddress1]","raddress2":"[raddress2]","city":"[city]","zip":"[zip]"},"sections":[{"title":{"value":"Ballot Submission Form","translations":{}},"intro":{"value":"Click the button below to review your ballot form.","translations":{}},"track":"statement-build","packageCode":"[formPackage]","lang":"en"}],"title":{"value":"Review Your Statement","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Revisar su declaración","zh-hant":"審查您的聲明","ko":"성명서 검토","pa":"ਆਪਣੇ ਬਿਆਨ ਦੀ ਸਮੀਖਿਆ ਕਰੋ","ru":"Просмотр заявления"}},"intro":{"value":"Click on the button below to review your statement. To make changes click the \"BACK\" button. Your statement will not be submitted until you click the \"SUBMIT\" button below","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Haga clic en el botón a continuación para revisar su declaración. Para realizar cambios, haga clic en el botón \"ATRÁS\". Su declaración no se enviará hasta que haga clic en el botón \"ENVIAR\" a continuación","zh-hant":"按下方按鈕即可審查您的聲明。如需變更，請按一下「返回」按鈕。只有在您按下方「提交」按鈕之後才會提交您的聲明","ko":"아래 버튼을 클릭해 성명서를 검토하십시오. 변경할 사항이 있다면 \"BACK(뒤로)\" 버튼을 클릭하십시오. 성명서는 아래 \"SUBMIT(제출)\" 버튼을 클릭하기 전까지 제출되지 않습니다","pa":"ਆਪਣੇ ਬਿਆਨ ਦੀ ਸਮੀਖਿਆ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ ਹੇਠਾਂ ਦਿੱਤੇ ਬਟਨ 'ਤੇ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ। ਤਬਦੀਲੀਆਂ ਕਰਨ ਲਈ \"ਪਿੱਛੇ ਜਾਓ\" ਬਟਨ 'ਤੇ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਕਰੋ। ਜਦੋਂ ਤੱਕ ਤੁਸੀਂ ਹੇਠਾਂ ਦਿੱਤੇ \"ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ ਕਰੋ\" ਬਟਨ 'ਤੇ ਕਲਿੱਕ ਨਹੀਂ ਕਰਦੇ ਹੋ, ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਬਿਆਨ ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ ਨਹੀਂ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾਵੇਗਾ","ru":"Нажмите на кнопку ниже, чтобы просмотреть заявление. Чтобы внести изменения, нажмите кнопку «НАЗАД». Заявление не будет отправлено, пока вы не нажмете кнопку «ОТПРАВИТЬ» ниже."}},"building":{"value":"Building your statement...","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Creando su declaración...","zh-hant":"正在生成您的聲明…","ko":"성명서 작성...","pa":"ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਬਿਆਨ ਬਣਾਇਆ ਜਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈ...","ru":"Готовим заявление…"}},"buildingError":{"value":"Error","translations":{}},"viewPackage":{"value":"Review Your Challenged Verification Statement","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Revise su declaración de verificación impugnada","zh-hant":"審查您的聲明","ko":"성명서 검토","pa":"ਆਪਣੇ ਬਿਆਨ ਦੀ ਸਮੀਖਿਆ ਕਰੋ","ru":"Просмотр заявления"}},"downloadPackage":{"value":"Download Challenged Verification Statement","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Descargar la Declaración de Verificación Impugnada","zh-hant":"","ko":"","pa":"","ru":""}},"deleteWarning":{"value":"<p>If you are on a public computer, be sure to permanently delete any downloaded files to protect your privacy.</p>","format":"text"},"continue":{"value":"Submit","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"ENVIAR","zh-hant":"提交","ko":"제출","pa":"ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ ਕਰੋ","ru":"ОТПРАВИТЬ"}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false,"prev":"signature","next":"statement-submit"},{"id":"statement-submit","type":"form-submit","next":"end-session","logicSets":[],"params":{"formId":3,"vid":"[vr:vid]","title":{"value":"Submit Your Statement","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Enviar su declaración","zh-hant":"提交您的聲明","ko":"성명서 제출","pa":"ਆਪਣਾ ਬਿਆਨ ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ ਕਰੋ","ru":"Отправить заявление"}},"submitting":{"value":"Submitting your statement...","format":"text","style":"","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Enviando su declaración...","zh-hant":"正在提交您的聲明…","ko":"성명서를 제출하는 중...","pa":"ਤੁਹਾਡਾ ਬਿਆਨ ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ ਕੀਤਾ ਜਾ ਰਿਹਾ ਹੈ...","ru":"Отправляем заявление…"}}},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"end-session","type":"end-session","params":{"title":{"value":"Successful Submission","format":"style","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"Envío exitoso","zh-hant":"提交成功","ko":"제출 성공","pa":"ਸਫਲਤਾ ਨਾਲ ਜਮ੍ਹਾਂ ਕੀਤਾ ਗਿਆ","ru":"Успешно отправлено"}},"intro":{"value":"<p><strong>Submission Complete</strong></p><p>Your Statement has been submitted to the Fresno County Elections Division.</p>","format":"html","style":"default","audio":{},"translations":{"es":"<p><strong>Env&iacute;o completo</strong></p><p>Su declaraci&oacute;n fue enviada a la Divisi&oacute;n de Elecciones del Condado de Fresno.</p>"}}},"ui":[],"logicSets":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false},{"id":"end-session-opt","type":"end-session","params":{"title":{"value":"Session Closed"},"intro":{"value":"<p>You have opted to end the process without completing your request.</p><p><a href=\"/form\">Click here to try again</a></p>","format":"html","style":"default","translations":{}},"hideActions":true},"ui":[],"hideContinueButton":false,"allowFirst":false,"resetSession":false}],"tokens":{}}],"globalRef":{},"footer":{"copyright":null},"ui":[],"tables":[]}